{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AnomalyForce-PM", "channelID": "ch-ix-pm-63119f"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_0c373165", "timestamp": "2026-05-06T13:44:00", "text": "One more thing, George. In the Challenges and Risks section, we should consider mentioning data privacy and security as potential challenges, given the sensitivity of data in industries like finance and healthcare. 🔒", "utterranceID": "20260506-6-f19f7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260506-6-f19f7"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AnomalyForce-PM", "channelID": "ch-ix-pm-63119f"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9f1ff493", "timestamp": "2026-05-06T13:48:00", "text": "Good catch, George. I'll add a note on data privacy and security concerns and how we plan to address them. Thanks for pointing that out! 🔍", "utterranceID": "20260506-7-7ffa2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260506-7-7ffa2"}
