{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidmiller-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-cca2c2"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b67edbb4", "timestamp": "2026-11-23T07:20:00", "text": "First up, we have an issue titled 'Unresponsive Control Sliders'. The control sliders for adjusting model parameters are becoming unresponsive intermittently. This affects the User Interface and is impacting Customer CUST-0090. @eid_67f8a879, this one's for you. Can you take a look?", "utterranceID": "20261122-1-f7f08"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261122-1-f7f08"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidmiller-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-cca2c2"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_67f8a879", "timestamp": "2026-11-23T07:21:00", "text": "Got it! I'll dive into the UI to see what's causing the unresponsiveness. Thanks for the heads-up! 👍", "utterranceID": "20261122-2-d0fb3"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261122-2-d0fb3"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidmiller-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-cca2c2"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b67edbb4", "timestamp": "2026-11-23T07:25:00", "text": "Great, thanks! Next, we have an 'Insecure Parameter Storage Mechanism'. Model parameters are being stored unencrypted, which is a security risk. This affects the Security Layer of the Parameter Adjustment Module and impacts Customer CUST-0019. @eid_9307fe85, can you handle this one?", "utterranceID": "20261122-3-19c5a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261122-3-19c5a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidmiller-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-cca2c2"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9307fe85", "timestamp": "2026-11-23T07:28:00", "text": "Absolutely, I'll prioritize encrypting the storage mechanism to secure those parameters. Thanks for assigning this to me! 🔒", "utterranceID": "20261122-4-ab1e6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261122-4-ab1e6"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidmiller-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-cca2c2"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b67edbb4", "timestamp": "2026-11-23T07:30:00", "text": "Awesome, thanks! Lastly, there's a 'Log Truncation During High Load' issue. Logs are getting truncated during high system load, affecting the Database Logging System. This is impacting Customer CUST-0053. @eid_15ac3a3b, can you take this on?", "utterranceID": "20261122-5-401d1"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261122-5-401d1"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidmiller-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-cca2c2"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_15ac3a3b", "timestamp": "2026-11-23T07:33:00", "text": "Sure thing! I'll investigate the logging system to ensure complete log entries even under high load. Let's keep those logs intact! 📈", "utterranceID": "20261122-6-6461c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261122-6-6461c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidmiller-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-force-cca2c2"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b67edbb4", "timestamp": "2026-11-23T07:37:00", "text": "Thanks, everyone! Let's keep communication open as you work through these. Feel free to reach out if you need any help or additional info. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20261122-7-b3cdd"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261122-7-b3cdd"}
