{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_82e9fcef", "timestamp": "2026-12-29T00:35:00", "text": "Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with ContextForce that we need to address. Let's go through them one by one. 😊", "utterranceID": "20261228-0-03eab"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261228-0-03eab"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_82e9fcef", "timestamp": "2026-12-29T00:36:00", "text": "First up, we have a concurrency issue in query execution. It's causing queries to be serialized rather than parallelized, which is increasing wait times for insight generation. This is impacting the Database Querying & Dashboard UI, and our customer CUST-0074 is affected. @eid_5782059f, can you take this one?", "utterranceID": "20261228-1-90ce1"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261228-1-90ce1"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_5782059f", "timestamp": "2026-12-29T00:38:00", "text": "Got it, I'll look into the concurrency issue and work on optimizing the query execution. Thanks for the heads-up! 🚀", "utterranceID": "20261228-2-6afae"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261228-2-6afae"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_82e9fcef", "timestamp": "2026-12-29T00:39:00", "text": "Great, thanks! Next, we have an issue with the AI model overfitting to a narrow set of user behaviors. This is affecting the AI Analysis Engine and causing users to receive less personalized insights, which is frustrating for customer CUST-0058. @eid_5782059f, this one's also for you.", "utterranceID": "20261228-3-1975a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261228-3-1975a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_5782059f", "timestamp": "2026-12-29T00:44:00", "text": "Understood, I'll dive into the AI model and work on improving its generalization. Let's make those insights more relevant! 💪", "utterranceID": "20261228-4-f6ac1"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261228-4-f6ac1"}
