{"Channel": {"name": "planning-FForceAIX", "channelID": "ch-ceaix-1ed316"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "slack_admin_bot", "timestamp": "2026-04-17T19:02:00", "text": "@eid_8558304e, @eid_2e028d1b joined planning-FForceAIX.", "utterranceID": "20260417-11-ac2e9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260417-11-ac2e9"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-FForceAIX", "channelID": "ch-ceaix-1ed316"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8558304e", "timestamp": "2026-04-19T08:02:00", "text": "Hi team, one of the common issues reported for FForceAIX is that the user interface is not intuitive for new users. This was reported by Customer ID: CUST-0074.", "utterranceID": "20260416-0-3fe58"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260416-0-3fe58"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-FForceAIX", "channelID": "ch-ceaix-1ed316"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2e028d1b", "timestamp": "2026-04-19T08:04:00", "text": "Thanks for bringing this up, Julia. Since the product was developed by a different team, we might need to dig into their design choices.", "utterranceID": "20260416-1-eaf3f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260416-1-eaf3f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-FForceAIX", "channelID": "ch-ceaix-1ed316"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_294ba09d", "timestamp": "2026-04-19T08:06:00", "text": "Yeah, I think the complex and cluttered UI layout could be overwhelming for new users. Maybe we should start there?", "utterranceID": "20260416-2-16ec4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260416-2-16ec4"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-FForceAIX", "channelID": "ch-ceaix-1ed316"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e5e36dc1", "timestamp": "2026-04-19T08:09:00", "text": "Good point, Alice. We should also consider if there are any guided tutorials or onboarding processes in place. Lack of these could be a big factor.", "utterranceID": "20260416-3-2c0a4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260416-3-2c0a4"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-FForceAIX", "channelID": "ch-ceaix-1ed316"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8558304e", "timestamp": "2026-04-19T08:11:00", "text": "@eid_2e028d1b, do we have any data on user feedback that was incorporated into the UI design improvements?", "utterranceID": "20260416-4-8a782"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260416-4-8a782"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-FForceAIX", "channelID": "ch-ceaix-1ed316"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2e028d1b", "timestamp": "2026-04-19T08:12:00", "text": "Not sure, Julia. I'll check if there's any documentation on user feedback from the previous team.", "utterranceID": "20260416-5-e7f59"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260416-5-e7f59"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-FForceAIX", "channelID": "ch-ceaix-1ed316"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_294ba09d", "timestamp": "2026-04-19T08:15:00", "text": "If there's insufficient user feedback, that could explain why the UI isn't meeting user expectations.", "utterranceID": "20260416-6-27677"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260416-6-27677"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-FForceAIX", "channelID": "ch-ceaix-1ed316"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e5e36dc1", "timestamp": "2026-04-19T08:20:00", "text": "Agreed. We should also think about implementing a more structured onboarding process for new users.", "utterranceID": "20260416-7-7bf97"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260416-7-7bf97"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-FForceAIX", "channelID": "ch-ceaix-1ed316"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8558304e", "timestamp": "2026-04-19T08:24:00", "text": "Let's make sure these customer issues are documented in the planning documents for the next release of FForceAIX.", "utterranceID": "20260416-8-42e8a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260416-8-42e8a"}
