{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicedavis-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-fbc815"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9a7b2132", "timestamp": "2026-09-15T06:49:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug titled 'Weak Password Policy Enforcement' has been resolved. You can check the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/FlowForce/pull/34.", "utterranceID": "20260915-0-c22f4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260915-0-c22f4"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicedavis-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-fbc815"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9a7b2132", "timestamp": "2026-09-15T06:51:00", "text": "The root cause was that our system wasn't enforcing password complexity requirements during password creation, which allowed users to set weak passwords.", "utterranceID": "20260915-1-b07e5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260915-1-b07e5"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicedavis-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-fbc815"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9a7b2132", "timestamp": "2026-09-15T06:52:00", "text": "To fix this, I updated the password validation logic to include checks for minimum length, uppercase and lowercase letters, numbers, and special characters. This should significantly reduce the risk of unauthorized access through brute force attacks.", "utterranceID": "20260915-2-33897"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260915-2-33897"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicedavis-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-fbc815"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f2474622", "timestamp": "2026-09-15T06:53:00", "text": "Great work, @eid_9a7b2132! Thanks for addressing this so quickly.", "utterranceID": "20260915-3-7e496"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260915-3-7e496"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicedavis-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-fbc815"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_399e4119", "timestamp": "2026-09-15T06:58:00", "text": "Thanks, Ian. This fix will definitely enhance our security posture. @eid_9a7b2132, did you also update the user guidelines to reflect the new password requirements?", "utterranceID": "20260915-4-68256"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260915-4-68256"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicedavis-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-fbc815"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9a7b2132", "timestamp": "2026-09-15T07:02:00", "text": "Yes, Fiona. I've updated the user documentation to include the new password guidelines. It should help users understand the requirements better.", "utterranceID": "20260915-5-2c691"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260915-5-2c691"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicedavis-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-fbc815"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e5e36dc1", "timestamp": "2026-09-15T07:03:00", "text": "Thanks, Ian. I'll make sure to communicate these changes to the support team so they can assist users if needed.", "utterranceID": "20260915-6-c172c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260915-6-c172c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicedavis-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-fbc815"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9a7b2132", "timestamp": "2026-09-15T07:06:00", "text": "Thanks, Alice. Let me know if there's anything else needed from my side.", "utterranceID": "20260915-7-2930d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260915-7-2930d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicedavis-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-fbc815"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f2474622", "timestamp": "2026-09-15T07:09:00", "text": "Thanks, everyone. Let's keep an eye on any feedback from users and see if further adjustments are necessary.", "utterranceID": "20260915-8-7cd3c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260915-8-7cd3c"}

{"Channel": {"name": "planning-FForceAIX", "channelID": "ch-ceaix-1ed316"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_294ba09d", "timestamp": "2026-05-16T03:54:00", "text": "Hi team, let's review the System Design Document and update it based on the latest issues reported. We've got some areas to address, especially around AI analysis, latency, UI, documentation, and reliability. Let's dive in! 😊", "utterranceID": "20260514-0-93e4e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260514-0-93e4e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-FForceAIX", "channelID": "ch-ceaix-1ed316"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_5827604d", "timestamp": "2026-05-16T03:59:00", "text": "@Alice Martinez, I think we should start by enhancing the AI Engine section. We need to mention the need for more diverse training data to handle complex API flows better. This could help with the misinterpretation issues.", "utterranceID": "20260514-1-23beb"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260514-1-23beb"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-FForceAIX", "channelID": "ch-ceaix-1ed316"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_51f50b3a", "timestamp": "2026-05-16T04:03:00", "text": "Agreed, @Hannah Martinez. Also, we should consider adding a subsection on advanced configuration options for complex flows. This could give users more control and potentially reduce misinterpretations.", "utterranceID": "20260514-2-e5d16"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260514-2-e5d16"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-FForceAIX", "channelID": "ch-ceaix-1ed316"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6936f36d", "timestamp": "2026-05-16T04:08:00", "text": "For the latency issue, maybe we should look into optimizing the Real-Time Processing Modules. We could specify the need for more efficient algorithms and better resource allocation during peak times.", "utterranceID": "20260514-3-85a96"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260514-3-85a96"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-FForceAIX", "channelID": "ch-ceaix-1ed316"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_5636d3f5", "timestamp": "2026-05-16T04:13:00", "text": "Yes, @Emma Jones, and perhaps we can add a section on real-time processing capabilities. This could help address the design limitations and ensure immediate optimization.", "utterranceID": "20260514-4-61b37"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260514-4-61b37"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-FForceAIX", "channelID": "ch-ceaix-1ed316"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_71bfb0a9", "timestamp": "2026-05-16T04:14:00", "text": "On the UI front, we should definitely include a plan for a more intuitive layout and guided tutorials. This could be a new section under Training and Support, focusing on onboarding processes.", "utterranceID": "20260514-5-5ca97"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260514-5-5ca97"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-FForceAIX", "channelID": "ch-ceaix-1ed316"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4e8b2cdc", "timestamp": "2026-05-16T04:18:00", "text": "For documentation, we need to emphasize the creation of a centralized knowledge base. This should include comprehensive guides for integrating with less common third-party APIs.", "utterranceID": "20260514-6-f499e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260514-6-f499e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-FForceAIX", "channelID": "ch-ceaix-1ed316"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_610a4c21", "timestamp": "2026-05-16T04:22:00", "text": "Good point, @Hannah Taylor. We should also allocate resources for regular updates to this documentation to keep it current.", "utterranceID": "20260514-7-6a9ab"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260514-7-6a9ab"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-FForceAIX", "channelID": "ch-ceaix-1ed316"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_294ba09d", "timestamp": "2026-05-16T04:24:00", "text": "Great suggestions, everyone! To summarize: we'll enhance the AI Engine section with more diverse training data and advanced configuration options, optimize the Real-Time Processing Modules for better latency management, improve the UI with intuitive layouts and tutorials, and create a centralized, regularly updated knowledge base for documentation. Let's assign these tasks and set a timeline for the updates. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20260514-8-a0303"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260514-8-a0303"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-FForceAIX", "channelID": "ch-ceaix-1ed316"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_294ba09d", "timestamp": "2026-05-16T12:21:00", "text": "Here is the updated <https://sf-internal.slack.com/archives/docs/new_fforceaix_system_design_document|System Design Document>, thank you everyone!", "utterranceID": "20260516-0-303d1"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260516-0-303d1"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b3b2e4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d0d918f1", "timestamp": "2026-11-02T20:09:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug about incorrect bottleneck identification in the FlowForce feature has been resolved. You can check the details in the PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/FlowForce/pull/44.", "utterranceID": "20261102-0-4df84"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261102-0-4df84"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b3b2e4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d0d918f1", "timestamp": "2026-11-02T20:14:00", "text": "The root cause was an error in the machine learning model's training data. It included mislabeled examples of bottlenecks, which led to inaccurate flagging of API endpoints.", "utterranceID": "20261102-1-1c266"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261102-1-1c266"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b3b2e4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d0d918f1", "timestamp": "2026-11-02T20:19:00", "text": "To fix this, we retrained the model with a corrected dataset and implemented additional validation checks to ensure the accuracy of bottleneck identification. This should prevent similar issues in the future.", "utterranceID": "20261102-2-98425"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261102-2-98425"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b3b2e4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_294ba09d", "timestamp": "2026-11-02T20:20:00", "text": "Great work, Charlie Miller! Thanks for the update. I'll review the PR shortly.", "utterranceID": "20261102-3-f1199"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261102-3-f1199"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b3b2e4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d098d618", "timestamp": "2026-11-02T20:24:00", "text": "Thanks, @eid_d0d918f1. It's good to know the root cause was addressed. Do we need to inform the users about this fix?", "utterranceID": "20261102-4-d009c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261102-4-d009c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b3b2e4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d0d918f1", "timestamp": "2026-11-02T20:29:00", "text": "Yes, @eid_d098d618, a notification to the users would be helpful. We should also update the documentation to reflect the changes.", "utterranceID": "20261102-5-cc5de"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261102-5-cc5de"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b3b2e4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b6268ef7", "timestamp": "2026-11-02T20:34:00", "text": "Thanks for the quick turnaround, Charlie Miller. I'll coordinate with the documentation team to get the updates done.", "utterranceID": "20261102-6-3a3a7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261102-6-3a3a7"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b3b2e4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d0d918f1", "timestamp": "2026-11-02T20:36:00", "text": "Perfect, thanks Charlie Taylor. Let me know if you need any more details from my side.", "utterranceID": "20261102-7-86e85"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261102-7-86e85"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b3b2e4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_294ba09d", "timestamp": "2026-11-13T16:10:00", "text": "Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with FlowForce that need our attention. Let's go through them one by one. 😊", "utterranceID": "20261113-0-ec2f1"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261113-0-ec2f1"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b3b2e4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_294ba09d", "timestamp": "2026-11-13T16:13:00", "text": "First up, we have an issue titled 'Incorrect Data Aggregation in Summary Views'. The summary views in the FlowForce dashboard are displaying incorrect aggregated data. This is impacting the User Interface & Data Visualization Module and causing frustration for Customer CUST-0018. @eid_d098d618, this one's for you.", "utterranceID": "20261113-1-e1bcc"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261113-1-e1bcc"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b3b2e4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d098d618", "timestamp": "2026-11-13T16:15:00", "text": "Got it! I'll start looking into the data aggregation issue right away. Thanks for the heads-up! 👍", "utterranceID": "20261113-2-fdf4e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261113-2-fdf4e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b3b2e4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_294ba09d", "timestamp": "2026-11-13T16:19:00", "text": "Great, thanks! Next, we have 'Delayed Data Refresh in Real-Time Dashboards'. The real-time dashboards aren't updating promptly, which is also affecting the User Interface & Data Visualization Module. This is causing issues for Customer CUST-0007. @eid_d0d918f1, can you take this one?", "utterranceID": "20261113-3-e2566"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261113-3-e2566"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b3b2e4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d0d918f1", "timestamp": "2026-11-13T16:24:00", "text": "Sure thing! I'll dive into the real-time dashboard refresh issue and see what's causing the delay. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20261113-4-aa5de"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261113-4-aa5de"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b3b2e4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_294ba09d", "timestamp": "2026-11-13T16:28:00", "text": "Awesome, thanks! Lastly, we have 'Data Loss During High-Volume Transactions'. Some API flow data is being lost during synchronization under high transaction volumes. This affects the Database & Data Synchronization Module and is impacting Customer CUST-0038. @eid_d098d618, this one's also for you.", "utterranceID": "20261113-5-1a8c6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261113-5-1a8c6"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b3b2e4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d098d618", "timestamp": "2026-11-13T16:33:00", "text": "Understood, I'll handle the data loss issue as well. I'll make sure to prioritize both tasks and keep everyone updated. 💪", "utterranceID": "20261113-6-30008"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261113-6-30008"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b3b2e4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_294ba09d", "timestamp": "2026-11-13T16:37:00", "text": "Thanks, everyone! Let's make sure to keep the customers updated on our progress. Feel free to reach out if you need any help or additional resources. Let's get these issues resolved! 🙌", "utterranceID": "20261113-7-9dab1"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261113-7-9dab1"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicemartinez-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-b3b2e4"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d0d918f1", "timestamp": "2026-11-13T16:42:00", "text": "Will do! Thanks for coordinating, @eid_294ba09d. Let's get to work! 🔧", "utterranceID": "20261113-8-2a1e2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261113-8-2a1e2"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicedavis-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-fbc815"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e5e36dc1", "timestamp": "2026-10-04T12:18:00", "text": "Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with FlowForce that need our attention. Let's go through them one by one. 😊", "utterranceID": "20261004-0-19c5c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261004-0-19c5c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicedavis-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-fbc815"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e5e36dc1", "timestamp": "2026-10-04T12:21:00", "text": "First up, we have an issue titled 'Erroneous Dependency Mapping'. FlowForce is generating incorrect dependency maps for API flows. This affects the AI Model & Analysis Engine and could lead users to optimize the wrong endpoints. Customer ID: CUST-0059 is impacted. @eid_8605f7ee, this one's for you.", "utterranceID": "20261004-1-cb5f6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261004-1-cb5f6"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicedavis-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-fbc815"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8605f7ee", "timestamp": "2026-10-04T12:23:00", "text": "Got it, thanks for the heads-up! I'll dive into the AI Model & Analysis Engine and see what's causing the incorrect mappings. 🛠️", "utterranceID": "20261004-2-7112f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261004-2-7112f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicedavis-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-fbc815"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e5e36dc1", "timestamp": "2026-10-04T12:24:00", "text": "Great, thanks! Next, we have 'Insufficient Rate Limiting on Authentication Endpoints'. This is a security concern as it makes our endpoints vulnerable to brute force attacks. The Security & Authentication Module is affected, and it's a significant risk for Customer ID: CUST-0018. @eid_71071933, can you take this one?", "utterranceID": "20261004-3-5f6f9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261004-3-5f6f9"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicedavis-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-fbc815"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_71071933", "timestamp": "2026-10-04T12:29:00", "text": "Absolutely, I'll prioritize this and implement the necessary rate limiting to secure those endpoints. 🔒", "utterranceID": "20261004-4-24590"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261004-4-24590"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicedavis-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-fbc815"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e5e36dc1", "timestamp": "2026-10-04T12:30:00", "text": "Thanks, @eid_71071933! Lastly, we have 'Redundant API Call Routing'. FlowForce is routing API calls through unnecessary nodes, which is slowing down response times. This affects the Performance Optimization & Routing Logic, impacting Customer ID: CUST-0068. @eid_9a7b2132, can you handle this?", "utterranceID": "20261004-5-2641c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261004-5-2641c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-alicedavis-FlowForce", "channelID": "ch-force-fbc815"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9a7b2132", "timestamp": "2026-10-04T12:34:00", "text": "On it! I'll review the routing logic and optimize the paths to improve response times. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20261004-6-7cfc2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261004-6-7cfc2"}
