{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-09-12T05:16:00", "text": "Great, thanks! Next, we have a 'Misconfigured Export Permissions' issue. Users are able to export more data than they're authorized to, which could lead to data breaches. This is affecting CUST-0069. @eid_9f4e2c6f, you're on this one too.", "utterranceID": "20260911-3-1276e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260911-3-1276e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9f4e2c6f", "timestamp": "2026-09-12T05:19:00", "text": "Understood. I'll check the Data Export Module and fix the permissions. We definitely don't want any data breaches! 🔒", "utterranceID": "20260911-4-7aaca"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260911-4-7aaca"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-09-12T05:23:00", "text": "Thanks, @eid_9f4e2c6f! Lastly, we have an 'Improper Access Control in Export API' issue. Unauthorized users can access and export lead data, which is a big no-no. This is impacting CUST-0037. @eid_3f4b2681, can you take this one?", "utterranceID": "20260911-5-ae35b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260911-5-ae35b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3f4b2681", "timestamp": "2026-09-12T05:25:00", "text": "Absolutely, I'll look into the access control mechanisms in the Export API and tighten things up. Thanks for assigning it to me! 🔧", "utterranceID": "20260911-6-9917e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260911-6-9917e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-09-12T05:26:00", "text": "Awesome, thanks everyone for jumping on these so quickly! If you need any more details or run into any roadblocks, just shout. Let's keep our customers happy! 🚀", "utterranceID": "20260911-7-c75b7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260911-7-c75b7"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9f4e2c6f", "timestamp": "2026-09-12T05:29:00", "text": "Will do! Thanks for coordinating, @eid_99835861! 😊", "utterranceID": "20260911-8-5a937"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260911-8-5a937"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3f4b2681", "timestamp": "2026-09-12T05:33:00", "text": "Thanks, @eid_99835861! I'll keep you posted on the progress. 👍", "utterranceID": "20260911-9-80937"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260911-9-80937"}

{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-04-20T08:39:00", "text": "Hi team, let's review the System Design Document and update it based on the latest issues reported. We've got some challenges with AI misclassification, UI intuitiveness, CRM integration, performance during peak times, and system reliability. Let's dive in! 🚀", "utterranceID": "20260420-0-e8053"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260420-0-e8053"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b48f959b", "timestamp": "2026-04-20T08:41:00", "text": "Hey Ian, I think we should start by addressing the AI model issues. The document should include a section on regular model retraining and dataset updates to prevent misclassification. This could help with both overfitting and underfitting problems. Thoughts? 🤔", "utterranceID": "20260420-1-e91ad"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260420-1-e91ad"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a43a4389", "timestamp": "2026-04-20T08:42:13", "text": "@here Read about the impact of AI on sales and marketing in this article. It provides context on how systems like AIX are reshaping industries. https://www.techcrunch.com/2023/02/10/ai-impact-on-sales-and-marketing/", "utterranceID": "20260420-120-6c448"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260420-120-6c448"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-04-20T08:46:00", "text": "@eid_b48f959b Great point, Hannah! Adding a retraining schedule and dataset review process could really help. We should also specify the need for diverse datasets to reduce bias. Anyone else have thoughts on this?", "utterranceID": "20260420-2-4e6f4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260420-2-4e6f4"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b814ccfb", "timestamp": "2026-04-20T08:47:00", "text": "Agreed, Ian. Also, we should enhance the 'Future Enhancements' section to explicitly mention expanding our dataset sources and implementing bias detection mechanisms. This will align with our commitment to improving AI accuracy.", "utterranceID": "20260420-3-8cdcb"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260420-3-8cdcb"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_46e00bc4", "timestamp": "2026-04-20T08:50:00", "text": "For the UI issues, we need to integrate user feedback loops into the design process. The document should outline a plan for regular UX testing and feedback sessions. This will help us create a more intuitive interface. What do you think, @eid_99835861?", "utterranceID": "20260420-4-fd308"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260420-4-fd308"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-04-20T08:51:00", "text": "Absolutely, Julia. Let's add a section on UX improvements and user feedback integration. We should also consider adding a user onboarding guide to help new users navigate the system more effectively. @eid_88e74382, any thoughts from a QA perspective?", "utterranceID": "20260420-5-90a60"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260420-5-90a60"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_88e74382", "timestamp": "2026-04-20T08:56:00", "text": "From QA's side, ensuring that user feedback is actionable and integrated into our testing processes will be key. We should document a feedback-to-implementation workflow in the design document. This will help us track and prioritize user suggestions.", "utterranceID": "20260420-6-6ae66"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260420-6-6ae66"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8efef28a", "timestamp": "2026-04-20T08:58:00", "text": "Regarding CRM integration, we need to emphasize the importance of a modular architecture in the document. This will allow us to support multiple CRM systems more easily. We should also allocate more resources for maintaining these integrations.", "utterranceID": "20260420-7-91dfd"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260420-7-91dfd"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-04-20T09:02:00", "text": "Great suggestions, Bob. Let's update the 'System Architecture' section to highlight modularity and resource allocation for CRM integrations. @eid_7b85a749, any input on performance and reliability issues?", "utterranceID": "20260420-8-5a78a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260420-8-5a78a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_7b85a749", "timestamp": "2026-04-20T09:07:00", "text": "For performance, we should include a section on performance monitoring and scaling strategies. This will help us manage server capacity and resource allocation better. Also, adding a robust alerting system for reliability issues could prevent unexpected downtimes.", "utterranceID": "20260420-9-926db"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260420-9-926db"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-04-20T09:08:00", "text": "Thanks, Charlie. Let's incorporate those suggestions into the 'Scalability and Industry Suitability' section. To summarize, we'll add sections on AI retraining, UX feedback, modular architecture for CRM, and performance monitoring. Next steps: I'll draft these changes and share them for review. Thanks, everyone! 👍", "utterranceID": "20260420-10-e6fb8"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260420-10-e6fb8"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-AIX", "channelID": "ch-g-aix-f0202d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-04-21T11:41:00", "text": "Here is the updated <https://sf-internal.slack.com/archives/docs/new_aix_system_design_document|System Design Document>, thank you everyone!", "utterranceID": "20260421-0-f1d17"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260421-0-f1d17"}

