{"Channel": {"name": "develop-juliadavis-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch--paix-38c82b"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_31ca5b45", "timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:23:00", "text": "Can someone clarify what the new product direction is and how it affects the GraphQL schema?", "utterranceID": "20260915-2-b4f3f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260915-2-b4f3f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-juliadavis-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch--paix-38c82b"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9e0ce30d", "timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:25:00", "text": "The new direction focuses more on REST APIs for customer profiles instead of GraphQL, so this schema might not be needed anymore.", "utterranceID": "20260915-3-65700"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260915-3-65700"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-juliadavis-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch--paix-38c82b"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4de5cd7f", "timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:30:00", "text": "If we don't need the schema, reverting seems like the logical step. But are there any parts of the schema that could still be useful?", "utterranceID": "20260915-4-b7f91"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260915-4-b7f91"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-juliadavis-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch--paix-38c82b"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_71a4de1d", "timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:34:00", "text": "Good point. @eid_85a4de81, could you provide insight into whether any components of the schema might still align with the new direction?", "utterranceID": "20260915-5-779d4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260915-5-779d4"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-juliadavis-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch--paix-38c82b"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_85a4de81", "timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:37:00", "text": "Sure, the schema was quite comprehensive, but if we're shifting to REST, most of it might not be applicable. I can review it to see if any parts are salvageable.", "utterranceID": "20260915-6-20bdf"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260915-6-20bdf"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-juliadavis-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch--paix-38c82b"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_1cfce648", "timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:40:00", "text": "Thanks for the clarification. It seems like reverting is the best course of action unless we find something useful in the schema.", "utterranceID": "20260915-7-92ee3"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260915-7-92ee3"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-juliadavis-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch--paix-38c82b"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e37380e3", "timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:45:00", "text": "Agreed. @eid_85a4de81, could you start the process to revert the PR? Let us know if you find anything worth keeping.", "utterranceID": "20260915-8-2e11a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260915-8-2e11a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-juliadavis-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch--paix-38c82b"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_85a4de81", "timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:48:00", "text": "Understood. I'll take a closer look and start the revert process soon. I'll keep everyone updated on what I find.", "utterranceID": "20260915-9-b0ce2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260915-9-b0ce2"}

{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8df92d08", "timestamp": "2026-07-29T11:24:00", "text": "Hi team, let's review the System Design Document and update it based on the latest issues reported. We need to address the AI-generated pitches lacking context-specific nuances, performance slowdowns, limited CRM integration, UI complexity, and reliability issues. Let's dive in! 🚀", "utterranceID": "20260728-0-628df"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260728-0-628df"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_df39cc9e", "timestamp": "2026-07-29T11:26:00", "text": "@eid_8df92d08 Julia, for the AI-generated pitches, we should consider expanding the 'Core AI Engine' section to include plans for increasing training data diversity. This could help in capturing more industry-specific nuances. Thoughts?", "utterranceID": "20260728-1-95135"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260728-1-95135"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d9f42fd7", "timestamp": "2026-07-29T11:27:00", "text": "I agree with Emma. Additionally, we might want to mention enhancing NLP capabilities to better capture subtle nuances. This could be a key point in the 'Future Enhancements' section.", "utterranceID": "20260728-2-2747b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260728-2-2747b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_71a4de1d", "timestamp": "2026-07-29T11:29:00", "text": "For the performance issues, we should add a section on implementing load balancing strategies and optimizing backend processes. This could be part of the 'System Architecture' section to ensure scalability during peak times.", "utterranceID": "20260728-3-0172c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260728-3-0172c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4de5cd7f", "timestamp": "2026-07-29T11:30:00", "text": "Good point, Alice. We should also consider adding more details on server capacity planning and resource allocation strategies to handle high demand efficiently.", "utterranceID": "20260728-4-91d7d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260728-4-91d7d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_1cfce648", "timestamp": "2026-07-29T11:32:00", "text": "Regarding CRM integration, we need to expand the 'System Architecture' section to include more robust API support and compatibility with major CRM platforms. This will address the integration issues users are facing.", "utterranceID": "20260728-5-bd04b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260728-5-bd04b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e37380e3", "timestamp": "2026-07-29T11:37:00", "text": "@eid_1cfce648 Charlie, I think we should also mention potential partnerships with CRM providers in the 'Future Enhancements' section to improve integration options.", "utterranceID": "20260728-6-749c5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260728-6-749c5"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_31ca5b45", "timestamp": "2026-07-29T11:38:00", "text": "On the UI front, we should revise the 'User Interface' section to focus on simplifying the layout and adding user-friendly onboarding features. This will help new users get up to speed faster.", "utterranceID": "20260728-7-d4b04"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260728-7-d4b04"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_32ff39b2", "timestamp": "2026-07-29T11:39:00", "text": "Agreed, Fiona. We should also incorporate more user feedback into the UI design process to ensure it meets user needs effectively.", "utterranceID": "20260728-8-36da8"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260728-8-36da8"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_469598db", "timestamp": "2026-07-29T11:41:00", "text": "For reliability issues, we need to emphasize the importance of rigorous testing and quality assurance processes in the 'Core AI Engine' section. This will help ensure consistent output quality across different customer profiles.", "utterranceID": "20260728-9-37192"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260728-9-37192"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_66d09012", "timestamp": "2026-07-29T11:44:00", "text": "Yes, and we should highlight the need for better data quality management to reduce variability in output quality. This could be a part of the 'Data Security' section.", "utterranceID": "20260728-10-8e05f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260728-10-8e05f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_c0df5be6", "timestamp": "2026-07-29T11:45:00", "text": "Great suggestions, everyone! Let's make sure these changes are reflected in the document. I'll summarize the key changes and discuss the next steps. 😊", "utterranceID": "20260728-11-93cd5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260728-11-93cd5"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_965867b8", "timestamp": "2026-07-29T11:47:50", "text": "@here Read about the future of AI in sales and how tools like pAIX are setting new standards for customer engagement and sales effectiveness. https://www.techcrunch.com/2023/02/10/ai-sales-tools-future/", "utterranceID": "20260729-139-0ce2e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260729-139-0ce2e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8df92d08", "timestamp": "2026-07-29T11:50:00", "text": "Thanks for the input, team! Here's a summary of the key changes: 1) Expand AI training data and NLP capabilities, 2) Implement load balancing and optimize backend processes, 3) Enhance CRM integration and explore partnerships, 4) Simplify UI and incorporate user feedback, 5) Strengthen testing and data quality management. Let's aim to update the document by the end of the week. I'll coordinate with each of you for specific sections. 👍", "utterranceID": "20260728-12-9ea36"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260728-12-9ea36"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8df92d08", "timestamp": "2026-07-30T15:08:00", "text": "Here is the updated <https://sf-internal.slack.com/archives/docs/new_paix_system_design_document|System Design Document>, thank you everyone!", "utterranceID": "20260730-0-1c14c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260730-0-1c14c"}

