{"Channel": {"name": "planning-shAIX", "channelID": "ch-shaix-1539d5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "slack_admin_bot", "timestamp": "2026-09-06T23:26:00", "text": "@eid_6148bfae, @eid_abff6bea joined planning-shAIX.", "utterranceID": "20260906-12-ce9d4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260906-12-ce9d4"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-shAIX", "channelID": "ch-shaix-1539d5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6148bfae", "timestamp": "2026-09-07T07:20:00", "text": "Hi team, QA team found some issues in the last release of shAIX. The report came from QA Specialist eid_7c6dd6a6.", "utterranceID": "20260930-0-84eb2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260930-0-84eb2"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-shAIX", "channelID": "ch-shaix-1539d5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_439a052b", "timestamp": "2026-09-07T07:23:00", "text": "Thanks, Emma. What exactly did they find?", "utterranceID": "20260930-1-f00d3"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260930-1-f00d3"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-shAIX", "channelID": "ch-shaix-1539d5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f944b0ee", "timestamp": "2026-09-07T07:25:22", "text": "@here Read about how AI is redefining enterprise search in this article. It covers the impact of AI on improving search relevance and user experience. https://www.forbes.com/sites/forbestechcouncil/2023/ai-redefining-enterprise-search/", "utterranceID": "20260907-15-e8d4e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260907-15-e8d4e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-shAIX", "channelID": "ch-shaix-1539d5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6148bfae", "timestamp": "2026-09-07T07:26:00", "text": "The main issue is with integration. It seems inconsistent with third-party apps, leading to incomplete data retrieval.", "utterranceID": "20260930-2-17cfd"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260930-2-17cfd"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-shAIX", "channelID": "ch-shaix-1539d5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_abff6bea", "timestamp": "2026-09-07T07:31:00", "text": "Could it be an API compatibility issue? Maybe the third-party apps updated their APIs.", "utterranceID": "20260930-3-5bf0a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260930-3-5bf0a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-shAIX", "channelID": "ch-shaix-1539d5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d0b6cb92", "timestamp": "2026-09-07T07:32:00", "text": "@eid_abff6bea That's possible. We should check if there have been any recent changes in their API versions.", "utterranceID": "20260930-4-44fbc"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260930-4-44fbc"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-shAIX", "channelID": "ch-shaix-1539d5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6d14c4ec", "timestamp": "2026-09-07T07:36:00", "text": "Another angle could be operational. Maybe there's a lack of standardized integration protocols.", "utterranceID": "20260930-5-6e84b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260930-5-6e84b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-shAIX", "channelID": "ch-shaix-1539d5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_439a052b", "timestamp": "2026-09-07T07:40:00", "text": "Good point, David. Standardizing protocols could help reduce these inconsistencies.", "utterranceID": "20260930-6-d4514"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260930-6-d4514"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-shAIX", "channelID": "ch-shaix-1539d5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6148bfae", "timestamp": "2026-09-07T07:41:00", "text": "Also, the design might be lacking in error handling for integration failures. We should look into that.", "utterranceID": "20260930-7-055f5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260930-7-055f5"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-shAIX", "channelID": "ch-shaix-1539d5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d0b6cb92", "timestamp": "2026-09-07T07:46:00", "text": "Agreed, Emma. Better error handling could prevent data retrieval issues from going unnoticed.", "utterranceID": "20260930-8-dd322"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260930-8-dd322"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-shAIX", "channelID": "ch-shaix-1539d5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_abff6bea", "timestamp": "2026-09-07T07:49:00", "text": "Let's make sure to document these issues and potential causes in our planning documents for the next release.", "utterranceID": "20260930-9-2b74f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260930-9-2b74f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-shAIX", "channelID": "ch-shaix-1539d5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6d14c4ec", "timestamp": "2026-09-07T07:53:00", "text": "Yes, definitely. We need to ensure these are addressed in the next iteration of shAIX.", "utterranceID": "20260930-10-b6b58"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260930-10-b6b58"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-shAIX", "channelID": "ch-shaix-1539d5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_439a052b", "timestamp": "2026-09-07T07:54:00", "text": "I'll start drafting the documentation for this. Thanks, everyone!", "utterranceID": "20260930-11-fa310"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260930-11-fa310"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-shAIX", "channelID": "ch-shaix-1539d5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "slack_admin_bot", "timestamp": "2026-09-08T09:29:00", "text": "@eid_f944b0ee, @eid_5a940dab joined planning-shAIX.", "utterranceID": "20260908-25-0f05e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260908-25-0f05e"}

{"Channel": {"name": "planning-shAIX", "channelID": "ch-shaix-1539d5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_aa99608e", "timestamp": "2026-09-24T01:44:00", "text": "Hi team, let's review the Product Vision Document and update it based on the latest issues reported. We've got some challenges to address, like AI misinterpreting complex queries and integration inconsistencies. Let's dive in! 🚀", "utterranceID": "20260923-0-9f528"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260923-0-9f528"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-shAIX", "channelID": "ch-shaix-1539d5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6d14c4ec", "timestamp": "2026-09-24T01:45:00", "text": "Thanks, Julia! For the AI misinterpretation issue, I think we should enhance the 'Intelligent Search Algorithms' section. We could specify the need for improved NLU capabilities and more diverse training data for complex queries. Thoughts? 🤔", "utterranceID": "20260923-1-c2df5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260923-1-c2df5"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-shAIX", "channelID": "ch-shaix-1539d5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d0b6cb92", "timestamp": "2026-09-24T01:49:11", "text": "@here For those interested in AI search, the Haystack library is a fantastic resource for building search systems that understand context and intent. https://github.com/deepset-ai/haystack", "utterranceID": "20260924-101-2254f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260924-101-2254f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-shAIX", "channelID": "ch-shaix-1539d5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_abff6bea", "timestamp": "2026-09-24T01:50:00", "text": "@eid_6d14c4ec, I agree. We should also consider adding a subsection on user feedback loops to continuously refine these algorithms. This could help in adapting to new query patterns over time.", "utterranceID": "20260923-2-3afcc"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260923-2-3afcc"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-shAIX", "channelID": "ch-shaix-1539d5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_439a052b", "timestamp": "2026-09-24T01:54:00", "text": "On the integration front, maybe we should add a point under 'Integration' about establishing standardized protocols for third-party apps. This could help mitigate API compatibility issues.", "utterranceID": "20260923-3-fa265"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260923-3-fa265"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-shAIX", "channelID": "ch-shaix-1539d5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d0b6cb92", "timestamp": "2026-09-24T01:57:00", "text": "Good point, Alice. We should also enhance error handling mechanisms. Maybe a dedicated section on 'Error Handling and Recovery' could be beneficial? This would address incomplete data retrieval issues.", "utterranceID": "20260923-4-66b97"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260923-4-66b97"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-shAIX", "channelID": "ch-shaix-1539d5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6148bfae", "timestamp": "2026-09-24T02:02:00", "text": "For the performance issues, under 'Scalability', we might want to emphasize the need for better load balancing strategies and server resource optimization. This could help with the slow performance during peak times.", "utterranceID": "20260923-5-03564"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260923-5-03564"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-shAIX", "channelID": "ch-shaix-1539d5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_aa99608e", "timestamp": "2026-09-24T02:05:00", "text": "Great suggestions, everyone! 😊 Let's also consider adding more customization options in the 'User Interface' section to address the difficulty users face in customizing search parameters.", "utterranceID": "20260923-6-949f4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260923-6-949f4"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-shAIX", "channelID": "ch-shaix-1539d5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_abff6bea", "timestamp": "2026-09-24T02:09:00", "text": "Yes, and maybe a note on improving user training and documentation under 'Operational' aspects could be useful. This might help users better understand customization features.", "utterranceID": "20260923-7-3282a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260923-7-3282a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-shAIX", "channelID": "ch-shaix-1539d5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6d14c4ec", "timestamp": "2026-09-24T02:10:00", "text": "Regarding reliability, we should bolster the 'Performance Monitoring' section with more robust monitoring and alert systems. This could help us catch and address downtime issues more proactively.", "utterranceID": "20260923-8-75f25"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260923-8-75f25"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-shAIX", "channelID": "ch-shaix-1539d5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_aa99608e", "timestamp": "2026-09-24T02:12:00", "text": "Thanks for the input, team! Here's a quick summary: \n- Enhance NLU and training data in 'Intelligent Search Algorithms'\n- Add standardized protocols and error handling in 'Integration'\n- Improve load balancing in 'Scalability'\n- Expand customization in 'User Interface'\n- Strengthen monitoring in 'Performance Monitoring'\nLet's work on these updates and reconvene next week to finalize. 👍", "utterranceID": "20260923-9-0040b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260923-9-0040b"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-0527c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_12c203a5", "timestamp": "2027-03-01T16:40:00", "text": "Hi team, I looked into the reported issue about Cache Invalidation Issues in SearchForce.", "utterranceID": "20270301-0-f6e97"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270301-0-f6e97"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-0527c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_12c203a5", "timestamp": "2027-03-01T16:42:00", "text": "The concern was that cached search results were not being invalidated correctly, causing delays and outdated data to be served.", "utterranceID": "20270301-1-a8b49"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270301-1-a8b49"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-0527c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_12c203a5", "timestamp": "2027-03-01T16:44:00", "text": "After reviewing the cache invalidation logic, I found that the system is actually working as intended.", "utterranceID": "20270301-2-4410e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270301-2-4410e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-0527c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_12c203a5", "timestamp": "2027-03-01T16:47:00", "text": "The delays and stale data are due to a misconfiguration in the cache settings, not a flaw in the logic itself.", "utterranceID": "20270301-3-a6c48"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270301-3-a6c48"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-0527c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_12c203a5", "timestamp": "2027-03-01T16:52:00", "text": "I verified the configuration settings and confirmed that they were not optimized for the current load, which led to the issue.", "utterranceID": "20270301-4-060bd"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270301-4-060bd"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-0527c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_681e9def", "timestamp": "2027-03-01T16:57:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, George. So, it's more of a configuration issue rather than a bug?", "utterranceID": "20270301-5-5dbac"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270301-5-5dbac"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-0527c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_12c203a5", "timestamp": "2027-03-01T17:01:00", "text": "Exactly, @eid_681e9def. Adjusting the cache settings should resolve the delays without needing any code changes.", "utterranceID": "20270301-6-92f6b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270301-6-92f6b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-0527c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6d14c4ec", "timestamp": "2027-03-01T17:03:00", "text": "Good to know it's not a bug. Do we need to update any documentation or inform the ops team?", "utterranceID": "20270301-7-c79f3"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270301-7-c79f3"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-0527c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_12c203a5", "timestamp": "2027-03-01T17:06:00", "text": "Yes, David. I'll coordinate with the ops team to ensure the cache settings are optimized and update the documentation accordingly.", "utterranceID": "20270301-8-8743e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270301-8-8743e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-0527c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4eec2a5a", "timestamp": "2027-03-01T17:11:00", "text": "Thanks for clarifying, George. Let me know if you need any help with the documentation updates.", "utterranceID": "20270301-9-22940"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270301-9-22940"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-0527c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_12c203a5", "timestamp": "2027-03-01T17:16:00", "text": "Will do, Alice. Thanks everyone for your understanding. I'll keep you posted on the progress.", "utterranceID": "20270301-10-4a358"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270301-10-4a358"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-0527c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6d14c4ec", "timestamp": "2027-03-02T19:29:00", "text": "Hi team, the 'Cache Invalidation Issues' bug has been reopened by the customer. 🚨", "utterranceID": "20270302-0-5f355"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270302-0-5f355"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-0527c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_681e9def", "timestamp": "2027-03-02T19:34:00", "text": "Oh no, I thought we had this one sorted out. 😕", "utterranceID": "20270302-1-4b6c6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270302-1-4b6c6"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-0527c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_12c203a5", "timestamp": "2027-03-02T19:38:00", "text": "That's surprising! I remember we concluded it was a configuration issue. @David Williams, do we have more details on why it was reopened?", "utterranceID": "20270302-2-6d837"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270302-2-6d837"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-0527c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6d14c4ec", "timestamp": "2027-03-02T19:43:00", "text": "Yes, @George Johnson. The customer reported that the issue resurfaced after a recent update. They’re still seeing outdated search results. 📊", "utterranceID": "20270302-3-b4929"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270302-3-b4929"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-0527c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4eec2a5a", "timestamp": "2027-03-02T19:45:00", "text": "Could it be related to any recent changes in the caching layer or configurations? 🤔", "utterranceID": "20270302-4-85b24"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270302-4-85b24"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-0527c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_12c203a5", "timestamp": "2027-03-02T19:50:00", "text": "I'll take another look at the cache settings and recent changes. Maybe something got overlooked. Reassigning it to myself. 🔍", "utterranceID": "20270302-5-3f266"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270302-5-3f266"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-0527c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_681e9def", "timestamp": "2027-03-02T19:52:00", "text": "Thanks, George! Let us know if you need any help or if there's anything we can do to assist. 👍", "utterranceID": "20270302-6-88b37"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270302-6-88b37"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-0527c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_12c203a5", "timestamp": "2027-03-02T19:53:00", "text": "Will do, @Bob Miller. I'll keep everyone updated on what I find. Thanks for the support, team! 🙌", "utterranceID": "20270302-7-bc639"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270302-7-bc639"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-0527c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4eec2a5a", "timestamp": "2027-03-03T08:38:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug about incorrect search results due to indexing delays has been resolved. You can check the details in the PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/SearchForce/pull/32.", "utterranceID": "20270302-0-930fe"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270302-0-930fe"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-0527c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_12c203a5", "timestamp": "2027-03-03T08:41:00", "text": "Great news, @eid_4eec2a5a! Can you remind us what the root cause was?", "utterranceID": "20270302-1-dcb8b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270302-1-dcb8b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-0527c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4eec2a5a", "timestamp": "2027-03-03T08:42:00", "text": "Sure, George. The root cause was that the indexing process wasn't triggered immediately after data updates in the database. This caused a lag between the database state and the search index.", "utterranceID": "20270302-2-28610"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270302-2-28610"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-0527c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_681e9def", "timestamp": "2027-03-03T08:46:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, Alice. How did you manage to fix it?", "utterranceID": "20270302-3-3f3ca"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270302-3-3f3ca"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-0527c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4eec2a5a", "timestamp": "2027-03-03T08:47:00", "text": "I added a real-time event listener that triggers the indexing process as soon as a data update is detected. This ensures that the search index is updated almost instantly after any changes in the database.", "utterranceID": "20270302-4-b6385"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270302-4-b6385"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-0527c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6d14c4ec", "timestamp": "2027-03-03T08:49:00", "text": "Nice work, Alice! That should definitely improve the search accuracy.", "utterranceID": "20270302-5-b7779"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270302-5-b7779"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidwilliams-SearchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-0527c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4eec2a5a", "timestamp": "2027-03-03T08:54:00", "text": "Thanks, David! Let me know if you notice any further issues.", "utterranceID": "20270302-6-226b0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270302-6-226b0"}
