{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df5d4b7", "timestamp": "2026-09-22T10:09:00", "text": "Hi team, I looked into the reported issue about the 'Malformed JSON Response Parsing'.", "utterranceID": "20260921-0-c43da"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260921-0-c43da"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df5d4b7", "timestamp": "2026-09-22T10:12:00", "text": "The system was encountering errors when parsing JSON responses from Slack, which was leading to dropped messages and incomplete sentiment data.", "utterranceID": "20260921-1-c727b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260921-1-c727b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df5d4b7", "timestamp": "2026-09-22T10:15:00", "text": "After reviewing the issue, I've determined that it does not require a fix.", "utterranceID": "20260921-2-72c6a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260921-2-72c6a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_92294e45", "timestamp": "2026-09-22T10:16:00", "text": "Hey Bob, could you explain why it's not a bug?", "utterranceID": "20260921-3-cf27f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260921-3-cf27f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df5d4b7", "timestamp": "2026-09-22T10:20:00", "text": "Sure, @eid_92294e45. The JSON parser is actually functioning as expected. The errors were due to malformed JSON responses that were not compliant with Slack's API documentation.", "utterranceID": "20260921-4-e84f1"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260921-4-e84f1"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df5d4b7", "timestamp": "2026-09-22T10:23:00", "text": "These malformed responses are rare and typically result from network issues or third-party integrations sending unexpected data.", "utterranceID": "20260921-5-012cb"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260921-5-012cb"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-09-22T10:26:00", "text": "So, it's more of a data integrity issue rather than a bug in our system?", "utterranceID": "20260921-6-bdb18"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260921-6-bdb18"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df5d4b7", "timestamp": "2026-09-22T10:27:00", "text": "Exactly, Emma. Our system is designed to handle well-formed JSON as per the API specs. Handling every possible malformed structure would be inefficient and unnecessary.", "utterranceID": "20260921-7-325fc"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260921-7-325fc"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_92294e45", "timestamp": "2026-09-22T10:31:00", "text": "Thanks for clarifying, Bob. Did you take any action to verify this?", "utterranceID": "20260921-8-6f7e7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260921-8-6f7e7"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df5d4b7", "timestamp": "2026-09-22T10:34:00", "text": "Yes, I reviewed the logs and tested with both valid and intentionally malformed JSON. The system processed valid JSON correctly and only failed on malformed data, which is expected.", "utterranceID": "20260921-9-3c2d0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260921-9-3c2d0"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-09-22T10:37:00", "text": "Got it. Thanks for the thorough investigation, Bob.", "utterranceID": "20260921-10-949ce"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260921-10-949ce"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df5d4b7", "timestamp": "2026-09-22T10:41:00", "text": "No problem, happy to help! If any further issues arise, feel free to reach out.", "utterranceID": "20260921-11-8b26d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260921-11-8b26d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-09-30T16:45:00", "text": "Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with SentimentForce that we need to address. Let's go through them one by one. 😊", "utterranceID": "20260930-0-740a7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260930-0-740a7"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-09-30T16:46:00", "text": "First up, we have an issue titled 'Incorrect Sentiment Analysis Due to Emoji Misinterpretation'. The sentiment analysis engine is misinterpreting certain emojis, like the 'smiling face with smiling eyes', as negative. This affects the Sentiment Analysis Engine and impacts leaders who rely on accurate sentiment reports. Customer ID: CUST-0089. @eid_4df5d4b7, this one's for you.", "utterranceID": "20260930-1-33b52"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260930-1-33b52"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df5d4b7", "timestamp": "2026-09-30T16:50:00", "text": "Got it! I'll dive into the emoji interpretation logic and see what's causing the misinterpretation. Thanks for the heads-up! 👍", "utterranceID": "20260930-2-c30f5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260930-2-c30f5"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-09-30T16:51:00", "text": "Great, thanks! Next, we have an 'Inefficient Query Execution Plan' issue. The database management system is generating suboptimal query execution plans, leading to slow response times for sentiment reports. This affects the Database Management System and impacts Customer ID: CUST-0072. @eid_fa6ec727, can you take this one?", "utterranceID": "20260930-3-28eab"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260930-3-28eab"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa6ec727", "timestamp": "2026-09-30T16:54:00", "text": "Sure thing! I'll optimize the query execution plans to improve performance. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20260930-4-ceb34"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260930-4-ceb34"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-09-30T16:56:00", "text": "Awesome! Lastly, there's a 'Security Vulnerability in User Authentication'. There's a flaw allowing unauthorized access to sentiment analysis reports, which is a big privacy concern. This affects the User Authentication Module and impacts Customer ID: CUST-0105. @eid_fa6ec727, this one's also for you.", "utterranceID": "20260930-5-2031a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260930-5-2031a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa6ec727", "timestamp": "2026-09-30T16:57:00", "text": "Understood. I'll prioritize fixing this security issue to ensure data privacy. 🔒", "utterranceID": "20260930-6-8fbe4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260930-6-8fbe4"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-09-30T17:02:00", "text": "Thanks, everyone! Let's keep our customers happy and secure. If you need any more details or run into issues, just ping me. 😊", "utterranceID": "20260930-7-fa4cf"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260930-7-fa4cf"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df5d4b7", "timestamp": "2026-09-30T17:06:00", "text": "Will do! Thanks for coordinating, @eid_d96fb219!", "utterranceID": "20260930-8-690f9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260930-8-690f9"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa6ec727", "timestamp": "2026-09-30T17:10:00", "text": "Thanks, @eid_d96fb219! Let's get these sorted out. 💪", "utterranceID": "20260930-9-59ef7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260930-9-59ef7"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_31cb6db5", "timestamp": "2026-10-29T03:11:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug about incorrect sentiment scores on the dashboard, titled 'Sentiment Model Drift', has been resolved. You can check the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/SentimentForce/pull/42.", "utterranceID": "20261028-0-a22e3"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261028-0-a22e3"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_31cb6db5", "timestamp": "2026-10-29T03:12:00", "text": "The root cause was that our sentiment analysis model hadn't been retrained with recent data, which led to outdated or inaccurate sentiment scores being displayed.", "utterranceID": "20261028-1-ae66c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261028-1-ae66c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_31cb6db5", "timestamp": "2026-10-29T03:17:00", "text": "To fix this, I updated the model training pipeline to automatically incorporate new data every month. This ensures the model stays current and accurate. I've also added a monitoring system to alert us if the model's performance starts to degrade.", "utterranceID": "20261028-2-a2cdb"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261028-2-a2cdb"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6cc1a0f6", "timestamp": "2026-10-29T03:18:00", "text": "Great work, Ian! Thanks for getting this sorted out so quickly. The monitoring system sounds like a solid addition.", "utterranceID": "20261028-3-46138"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261028-3-46138"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_802e8eff", "timestamp": "2026-10-29T03:23:00", "text": "@eid_31cb6db5 Thanks, Ian! This should definitely improve the accuracy of our sentiment scores. Let me know if you need any help with the monitoring system.", "utterranceID": "20261028-4-37214"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261028-4-37214"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_31cb6db5", "timestamp": "2026-10-29T03:28:00", "text": "Thanks, David and Charlie! I'll keep you posted if anything else comes up. For now, everything looks good on my end.", "utterranceID": "20261028-5-7846b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261028-5-7846b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fc4619fa", "timestamp": "2026-10-30T09:07:00", "text": "Hi team, I looked into the reported issue about the time zone misalignment in data processing. After reviewing the bug, I've determined that it does not require a fix.", "utterranceID": "20261030-0-05849"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261030-0-05849"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarc

{"Channel": {"name": "develop-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-6723be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f4f58faa", "timestamp": "2026-11-11T03:20:00", "text": "Hi team, I was reading about ConvoClip, one of our competitors in the voice summarization space. I noticed a few areas where they seem to be struggling. Their summarization feature can have trouble with accents, which might be a significant issue for diverse user bases. They also offer limited customization options for summary formats, and there are reports of delays during peak usage times. Thought it would be good to discuss these points and see how we can leverage this info.", "utterranceID": "20261224-0-19d72"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261224-0-19d72"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-6723be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_320cd970", "timestamp": "2026-11-11T03:25:00", "text": "@David Garcia, that's interesting! 🤔 Do you know what kind of accents are most problematic for ConvoClip? This could be a big deal for international markets.", "utterranceID": "20261224-1-8742b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261224-1-8742b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-6723be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f4f58faa", "timestamp": "2026-11-11T03:30:00", "text": "Great question, Alice. From what I've gathered, ConvoClip struggles particularly with non-native English accents and regional dialects. This could limit their effectiveness in markets like India or Africa, where there's a wide variety of English accents.", "utterranceID": "20261224-2-7656b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261224-2-7656b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-6723be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_1f678d18", "timestamp": "2026-11-11T03:34:00", "text": "Thanks for the insights, @David Garcia. The limited customization options for summary formats—do you know what exactly is lacking there? Could this be a dealbreaker for some users?", "utterranceID": "20261224-3-93760"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261224-3-93760"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-6723be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f4f58faa", "timestamp": "2026-11-11T03:37:00", "text": "Sure, David. ConvoClip offers only a few preset formats for summaries, which might not meet the needs of users who require more tailored outputs. This could be a limitation for businesses that need specific formats for documentation or reporting.", "utterranceID": "20261224-4-aa054"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261224-4-aa054"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-6723be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2543da6a", "timestamp": "2026-11-11T03:38:00", "text": "Interesting point, @David Garcia. From a technical perspective, do you think these issues are due to limitations in their current tech stack, or is it more about their strategic focus?", "utterranceID": "20261224-5-937aa"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261224-5-937aa"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-6723be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f4f58faa", "timestamp": "2026-11-11T03:43:00", "text": "Alice Taylor, it seems like a bit of both. Their tech might not be robust enough to handle diverse accents efficiently, and they might not prioritize customization as a key feature. This could be an opportunity for us to differentiate our product.", "utterranceID": "20261224-6-51db6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261224-6-51db6"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-6723be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ec3b5d65", "timestamp": "2026-11-11T03:45:00", "text": "From a marketing standpoint, these weaknesses could be a goldmine for us. 🎯 If we highlight our strengths in these areas, we could attract users who are dissatisfied with ConvoClip's limitations. What do you think, @David Garcia?", "utterranceID": "20261224-7-28634"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261224-7-28634"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-6723be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f4f58faa", "timestamp": "2026-11-11T03:47:00", "text": "Absolutely, George. We should definitely emphasize our flexibility and accuracy in handling diverse accents in our marketing materials. It could be a strong selling point.", "utterranceID": "20261224-8-47933"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261224-8-47933"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-6723be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_320cd970", "timestamp": "2026-11-11T03:51:00", "text": "👍 Sounds like a solid plan. Let's keep an eye on how ConvoClip evolves, though. They might address these issues in future updates.", "utterranceID": "20261224-9-36f09"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261224-9-36f09"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-6723be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_1f678d18", "timestamp": "2026-11-11T03:55:00", "text": "Agreed, Alice Garcia. Continuous monitoring is key. Thanks for kicking off this discussion, @David Garcia. Very insightful!", "utterranceID": "20261224-10-fad16"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261224-10-fad16"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-6723be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f4f58faa", "timestamp": "2026-11-11T03:57:00", "text": "No problem, team! Let's keep the conversation going and see how we can turn these insights into actionable strategies. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20261224-11-e571d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261224-11-e571d"}

{"Channel": {"name": "develop-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-6723be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_625f445d", "timestamp": "2026-11-06T22:32:00", "text": "Hi team, I was reading about ThreadDigest, one of our competitors, and thought it would be useful to discuss some of its weaknesses. For starters, it requires manual setup for each new channel, which can be quite cumbersome for larger teams.", "utterranceID": "20261220-0-2613b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261220-0-2613b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-6723be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3f26c6e5", "timestamp": "2026-11-06T22:36:00", "text": "Interesting point, Charlie. Does that mean every time a new channel is created, someone has to manually configure it for ThreadDigest to work?", "utterranceID": "20261220-1-8d216"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261220-1-8d216"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-6723be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_625f445d", "timestamp": "2026-11-06T22:39:00", "text": "Exactly, Emma. Unlike some other solutions that offer automatic integration across channels, ThreadDigest requires a manual setup each time, which can be a hassle.", "utterranceID": "20261220-2-8c024"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261220-2-8c024"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-6723be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_5890ce38", "timestamp": "2026-11-06T22:41:00", "text": "🤔 That sounds like a scalability issue. How does it handle integration with other apps? Is it seamless?", "utterranceID": "20261220-3-dd7fd"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261220-3-dd7fd"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-6723be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_625f445d", "timestamp": "2026-11-06T22:46:00", "text": "Good question, George. Their basic plan actually lacks integration with other apps. So, if a team wants to connect ThreadDigest with tools like Trello or Jira, they'd need to upgrade to a higher plan.", "utterranceID": "20261220-4-d75a4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261220-4-d75a4"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-6723be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_1f678d18", "timestamp": "2026-11-06T22:48:00", "text": "That's a bit limiting. In fast-paced environments, integration is key. How about the quality of their summaries? Do they capture the essence of discussions well?", "utterranceID": "20261220-5-7c7c2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261220-5-7c7c2"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-6723be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_625f445d", "timestamp": "2026-11-06T22:52:00", "text": "That's another area where they struggle, David. Their summaries can miss context, especially in fast-paced discussions. This can lead to misunderstandings or missing out on critical points.", "utterranceID": "20261220-6-8e579"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261220-6-8e579"}
