{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgebrown-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-42e754"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_86044ae5", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T14:22:00", "text": "Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with ForecastForce that we need to address ASAP. Let's go through them one by one. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20261115-0-04d7c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261115-0-04d7c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgebrown-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-42e754"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_86044ae5", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T14:23:00", "text": "First up, we have a 'Missing Value Imputation Fault'. The imputation process is introducing bias, which affects the accuracy of trend predictions. This is impacting the Data Preprocessing Module and customer CUST-0112. @eid_dbc6178f, can you take this one?", "utterranceID": "20261115-1-cf73c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261115-1-cf73c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgebrown-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-42e754"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_dbc6178f", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T14:26:00", "text": "Got it! I'll dive into the Data Preprocessing Module and see what's causing the bias. Thanks for the heads-up, @eid_86044ae5. 👍", "utterranceID": "20261115-2-384b3"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261115-2-384b3"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgebrown-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-42e754"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_86044ae5", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T14:27:00", "text": "Great, thanks! Next, we have an 'OAuth Token Leakage' issue. OAuth tokens are being exposed in URL query parameters, which is a security risk. This affects the Authentication Module and customer CUST-0120. @eid_8a3b36d4, can you handle this?", "utterranceID": "20261115-3-7a5e6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261115-3-7a5e6"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgebrown-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-42e754"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8a3b36d4", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T14:30:00", "text": "Absolutely, I'll start looking into the Authentication Module to secure those tokens. Thanks for assigning this to me, @eid_86044ae5. 🔒", "utterranceID": "20261115-4-2f4cc"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261115-4-2f4cc"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgebrown-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-42e754"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_86044ae5", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T14:34:00", "text": "Thanks, @eid_8a3b36d4! Lastly, there's a 'Time Series Aggregation Error'. The data preprocessing module is incorrectly aggregating time series data, leading to inaccurate trend predictions. This is also affecting the Data Preprocessing Module and customer CUST-0015. @eid_1bf91687, can you take this one?", "utterranceID": "20261115-5-7dc10"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261115-5-7dc10"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgebrown-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-42e754"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_1bf91687", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T14:35:00", "text": "On it! I'll check the aggregation logic in the Data Preprocessing Module. Thanks for the update, @eid_86044ae5. 📊", "utterranceID": "20261115-6-ba339"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261115-6-ba339"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgebrown-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-42e754"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_86044ae5", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T14:36:00", "text": "Awesome, thanks everyone for jumping on these issues so quickly! Let's keep the impacted customers updated as we make progress. Feel free to reach out if you need any more info or help. 🙌", "utterranceID": "20261115-7-1f623"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261115-7-1f623"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgebrown-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-42e754"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_dbc6178f", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T14:37:00", "text": "Will do! I'll keep you posted on the imputation fix. 😊", "utterranceID": "20261115-8-5121c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261115-8-5121c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgebrown-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-42e754"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8a3b36d4", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T14:40:00", "text": "Same here, I'll update once the token issue is resolved. 🔧", "utterranceID": "20261115-9-a4fa0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261115-9-a4fa0"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgebrown-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-42e754"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_1bf91687", "timestamp": "2026-11-15T14:45:00", "text": "I'll make sure to provide updates on the aggregation error as well. Thanks, team! 🚀", "utterranceID": "20261115-10-18f47"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261115-10-18f47"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgebrown-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-42e754"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_1bf91687", "timestamp": "2026-12-01T06:18:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug about incorrect time series aggregation has been resolved. You can check the details in the PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/ForecastForce/pull/40.", "utterranceID": "20261201-0-3954a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261201-0-3954a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgebrown-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-42e754"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_1bf91687", "timestamp": "2026-12-01T06:22:00", "text": "The root cause was a misconfiguration in the aggregation logic. We were using an incorrect time interval, which distorted the input data for our forecasting model.", "utterranceID": "20261201-1-b7a67"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261201-1-b7a67"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgebrown-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-42e754"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_1bf91687", "timestamp": "2026-12-01T06:24:00", "text": "To fix it, I updated the configuration to ensure the correct time intervals are used for aggregation. This involved modifying the logic to dynamically adjust based on the dataset's frequency.", "utterranceID": "20261201-2-0803a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261201-2-0803a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgebrown-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-42e754"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_86044ae5", "timestamp": "2026-12-01T06:28:00", "text": "Great work, @eid_1bf91687! Thanks for resolving this so quickly. I'll test it out with the latest data.", "utterranceID": "20261201-3-6ab4c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261201-3-6ab4c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgebrown-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-42e754"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_dbc6178f", "timestamp": "2026-12-01T06:30:00", "text": "Thanks, Julia! This should improve our trend predictions significantly. I'll update the documentation to reflect these changes.", "utterranceID": "20261201-4-b9bfb"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261201-4-b9bfb"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgebrown-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-42e754"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8a3b36d4", "timestamp": "2026-12-01T06:33:00", "text": "Awesome job, Julia! Let me know if there's anything else you need from my side.", "utterranceID": "20261201-5-8ec3f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261201-5-8ec3f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgebrown-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-42e754"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_1bf91687", "timestamp": "2026-12-01T06:37:00", "text": "Thanks, George, Hannah, and Alice! Let me know if you encounter any issues during testing. Happy to help further if needed.", "utterranceID": "20261201-6-762ae"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261201-6-762ae"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgebrown-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-42e754"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_86044ae5", "timestamp": "2026-12-17T08:15:00", "text": "Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with ForecastForce that we need to address. Let's go through them one by one. 😊", "utterranceID": "20261217-0-6cc0b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261217-0-6cc0b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgebrown-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-42e754"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_86044ae5", "timestamp": "2026-12-17T08:19:00", "text": "First up, we have a security vulnerability in the User Authentication module. It allows unauthorized access through a brute force attack on the login endpoint. This is critical as it puts user accounts at risk, potentially exposing sensitive forecast data. Impacted customer: CUST-0026. @eid_1bf91687, this one's for you.", "utterranceID": "20261217-1-02cdc"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261217-1-02cdc"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgebrown-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-42e754"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_1bf91687", "timestamp": "2026-12-17T08:22:00", "text": "Got it, I'll prioritize this security issue and start working on it immediately. Thanks for the heads-up! 🔒", "utterranceID": "20261217-2-4cc1e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261217-2-4cc1e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgebrown-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-42e754"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_86044ae5", "timestamp": "2026-12-17T08:26:00", "text": "Thanks, @eid_1bf91687! Next, we have an issue with the API's rate limiting feedback. It's giving incorrect feedback, sometimes indicating a request was successful when it was actually throttled. This could lead to data handling errors for developers integrating with our API. Impacted customer: CUST-0071. @eid_1bf91687, this is also for you.", "utterranceID": "20261217-3-b6bef"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261217-3-b6bef"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgebrown-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-42e754"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_1bf91687", "timestamp": "2026-12-17T08:27:00", "text": "Understood, I'll look into the API rate limiting feedback issue as well. I'll make sure to get this sorted out. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20261217-4-eb58c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261217-4-eb58c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgebrown-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-42e754"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_86044ae5", "timestamp": "2026-12-17T08:29:00", "text": "Awesome, thanks again! Lastly, there's an issue with the API endpoint returning incorrect HTTP status codes, like 200 OK for failed requests. This could cause developers to misinterpret request outcomes. Impacted customer: CUST-0064. @eid_8a3b36d4, can you take this one?", "utterranceID": "20261217-5-e2d33"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261217-5-e2d33"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgebrown-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-42e754"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8a3b36d4", "timestamp": "2026-12-17T08:31:00", "text": "Sure thing! I'll dive into the API status code issue and get it fixed. Thanks for assigning it to me. 👍", "utterranceID": "20261217-6-5aaac"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261217-6-5aaac"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgebrown-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-42e754"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_86044ae5", "timestamp": "2026-12-17T08:35:00", "text": "Great, thanks everyone for jumping on these issues so quickly. Let's keep our customers happy! If you need any more details or run into any roadblocks, just shout. 💪", "utterranceID": "20261217-7-c5f39"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261217-7-c5f39"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgebrown-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-42e754"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_1bf91687", "timestamp": "2026-12-17T08:40:00", "text": "Will do! Thanks for coordinating, @eid_86044ae5. 😊", "utterranceID": "20261217-8-eb1ab"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261217-8-eb1ab"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgebrown-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-42e754"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8a3b36d4", "timestamp": "2026-12-17T08:42:00", "text": "Thanks, @eid_86044ae5! I'll keep you posted on the progress. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20261217-9-981cf"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261217-9-981cf"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgebrown-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-42e754"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_dbc6178f", "timestamp": "2026-10-12T20:58:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug about inconsistent JSON response structure has been resolved. You can check the details in the PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/ForecastForce/pull/35.", "utterranceID": "20261012-0-69058"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261012-0-69058"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgebrown-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-42e754"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_dbc6178f", "timestamp": "2026-10-12T21:00:00", "text": "The root cause was a race condition in the serialization process. When multiple requests were processed concurrently, it led to inconsistent response formatting.", "utterranceID": "20261012-1-47fdd"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261012-1-47fdd"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgebrown-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-42e754"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_dbc6178f", "timestamp": "2026-10-12T21:03:00", "text": "To fix this, I implemented a locking mechanism around the serialization process to ensure that each request is handled sequentially. This prevents any overlap that could cause missing or additional fields in the JSON response.", "utterranceID": "20261012-2-37617"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261012-2-37617"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgebrown-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-42e754"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_86044ae5", "timestamp": "2026-10-12T21:07:00", "text": "Great work, @eid_dbc6178f! Thanks for the quick turnaround on this. I'll test it on my end to ensure everything's working smoothly.", "utterranceID": "20261012-3-0548c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261012-3-0548c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgebrown-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-42e754"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2604c806", "timestamp": "2026-10-12T21:10:00", "text": "Thanks, Hannah! This should help reduce the errors we've been seeing in the client applications. I'll update the team on the client side.", "utterranceID": "20261012-4-946a9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261012-4-946a9"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgebrown-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-42e754"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_1bf91687", "timestamp": "2026-10-12T21:15:00", "text": "Awesome! Thanks for the update, Hannah. Let me know if there's anything else you need from the QA side.", "utterranceID": "20261012-5-d1b4b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261012-5-d1b4b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgebrown-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-42e754"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_dbc6178f", "timestamp": "2026-10-12T21:18:00", "text": "Thanks, everyone! @George Brown, let me know if you encounter any issues during testing. @Julia Miller, I'll reach out if I need further QA support.", "utterranceID": "20261012-6-4c7fc"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261012-6-4c7fc"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgebrown-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-42e754"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2604c806", "timestamp": "2026-10-17T11:27:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug titled 'Inadequate GPU Utilization' has been resolved. You can check out the details in the PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/ForecastForce/pull/36.", "utterranceID": "20261017-0-8b548"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261017-0-8b548"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgebrown-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-42e754"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2604c806", "timestamp": "2026-10-17T11:28:00", "text": "The root cause was that our rendering engine was relying too much on CPU processing and wasn't offloading enough tasks to the GPU. This led to slow rendering times for complex visualizations, especially with large datasets.", "utterranceID": "20261017-1-afd3a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261017-1-afd3a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgebrown-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-42e754"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2604c806", "timestamp": "2026-10-17T11:29:00", "text": "To fix this, I updated the rendering engine to better distribute tasks between the CPU and GPU. Now, computationally intensive tasks are offloaded to the GPU, which should improve rendering performance significantly.", "utterranceID": "20261017-2-2ae6f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261017-2-2ae6f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgebrown-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-42e754"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_86044ae5", "timestamp": "2026-10-17T11:34:00", "text": "Great work, @eid_2604c806! This should really help with the performance issues we've been seeing.", "utterranceID": "20261017-3-d0e6b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261017-3-d0e6b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgebrown-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-42e754"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_dbc6178f", "timestamp": "2026-10-17T11:38:00", "text": "Thanks, George Jones! This was a critical fix. I'll run some tests with larger datasets to see the improvements.", "utterranceID": "20261017-4-7dea0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261017-4-7dea0"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgebrown-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-42e754"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_1bf91687", "timestamp": "2026-10-17T11:42:00", "text": "Awesome job, @eid_2604c806! Let me know if you need any help with further testing or documentation.", "utterranceID": "20261017-5-a195c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261017-5-a195c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgebrown-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-42e754"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2604c806", "timestamp": "2026-10-17T11:43:00", "text": "Thanks, everyone! @eid_dbc6178f, let me know how the tests go. @eid_1bf91687, I'll reach out if I need any assistance. Appreciate the support!", "utterranceID": "20261017-6-adf9a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261017-6-adf9a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgebrown-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-42e754"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_86044ae5", "timestamp": "2026-10-20T21:52:00", "text": "Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with ForecastForce that we need to address. Let's go through them one by one. 😊", "utterranceID": "20261020-0-b1d9c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261020-0-b1d9c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgebrown-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-42e754"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_86044ae5", "timestamp": "2026-10-20T21:55:00", "text": "First up, we have a 'Feature Scaling Anomaly' in the Data Preprocessing Module. This is causing inconsistent feature scaling, leading to incorrect trend predictions. Customer CUST-0021 is impacted. @eid_dbc6178f, can you take this one?", "utterranceID": "20261020-1-ff13f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261020-1-ff13f"}
