{"Channel": {"name": "develop-georgegarcia-InsightForce", "channelID": "ch-htaix-cd6571"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3f3ea10f", "timestamp": "2026-05-06T15:34:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, @eid_9e9883de. Given this change, it seems like merging the PR might not be the best move. What do others think?", "utterranceID": "20260506-4-4b06f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260506-4-4b06f"}
