{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f603c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e4d35074", "timestamp": "2027-02-07T15:05:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug titled 'Inconsistent Layout Across Mobile Browsers' has been resolved. You can check the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/PitchForce/pull/52.", "utterranceID": "20270207-0-f0c07"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270207-0-f0c07"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f603c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8df92d08", "timestamp": "2027-02-07T15:10:00", "text": "That's great news, Ian! Can you explain what was causing the inconsistency?", "utterranceID": "20270207-1-d560b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270207-1-d560b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f603c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e4d35074", "timestamp": "2027-02-07T15:15:00", "text": "Sure, Julia. The root cause was the use of CSS properties that aren't uniformly supported across all mobile browsers. This led to variations in how elements were displayed.", "utterranceID": "20270207-2-b3d0f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270207-2-b3d0f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f603c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_7687dbe6", "timestamp": "2027-02-07T15:19:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, Ian. How did you manage to fix it?", "utterranceID": "20270207-3-384d1"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270207-3-384d1"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f603c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e4d35074", "timestamp": "2027-02-07T15:20:00", "text": "I replaced the problematic CSS properties with more universally supported ones and added a few media queries to ensure consistent rendering. This should now provide a uniform layout across all mobile browsers.", "utterranceID": "20270207-4-bb36f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270207-4-bb36f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f603c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8df92d08", "timestamp": "2027-02-07T15:22:00", "text": "Awesome work, @eid_e4d35074! I'll test it on a few devices to confirm everything looks good.", "utterranceID": "20270207-5-040b7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270207-5-040b7"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f603c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_7687dbe6", "timestamp": "2027-02-07T15:25:00", "text": "Thanks, Ian. Let us know if there's anything else we need to keep an eye on.", "utterranceID": "20270207-6-b09c1"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270207-6-b09c1"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f603c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e4d35074", "timestamp": "2027-02-07T15:28:00", "text": "Thanks, Fiona. I'll keep you posted if anything comes up. Appreciate the support, team!", "utterranceID": "20270207-7-6ffc6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270207-7-6ffc6"}
