{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f603c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8df92d08", "timestamp": "2027-02-19T15:15:00", "text": "First up, we have a problem with 'Gesture Recognition Failures'. Mobile users are having trouble with swipe gestures, which is affecting their navigation experience. This is impacting customer CUST-0011. @eid_a041a433, can you take this one? It's in the User Interface & Mobile Compatibility area.", "utterranceID": "20270219-1-fdd8e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270219-1-fdd8e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f603c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a041a433", "timestamp": "2027-02-19T15:17:00", "text": "Got it! I'll look into the gesture recognition issue right away. Thanks for the heads-up! 👍", "utterranceID": "20270219-2-5426d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270219-2-5426d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f603c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8df92d08", "timestamp": "2027-02-19T15:19:00", "text": "Great, thanks! Next, we have an 'Inefficient Caching Strategy' issue. The caching isn't working as expected, causing slower response times and impacting productivity. This is affecting customer CUST-0111. @eid_2e1d6568, could you handle this one? It's related to Backend Infrastructure & Performance.", "utterranceID": "20270219-3-a671b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270219-3-a671b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f603c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2e1d6568", "timestamp": "2027-02-19T15:23:00", "text": "Sure thing! I'll dive into the caching strategy and see what's going wrong. Thanks for assigning it to me. 😊", "utterranceID": "20270219-4-fb6d6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270219-4-fb6d6"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f603c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8df92d08", "timestamp": "2027-02-19T15:24:00", "text": "Thanks, @eid_2e1d6568! Lastly, there's an issue with 'Exposed Debug Information in API Responses'. This is a serious security concern as it exposes sensitive data. It's impacting customer CUST-0026. @eid_a041a433, can you also take this one since it's in the API Security & Access Control area?", "utterranceID": "20270219-5-d72cb"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270219-5-d72cb"}
