{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_66d09012", "timestamp": "2026-07-10T09:53:00", "text": "Thanks for bringing this up, Hannah. Since the product was developed by a different team, we might need to dig into their documentation to understand the current integration capabilities.", "utterranceID": "20260704-1-f0a1a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260704-1-f0a1a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-pAIX", "channelID": "ch--paix-374b62"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_df39cc9e", "timestamp": "2026-07-10T09:56:00", "text": "Good point, George. I suspect the lack of API support or compatibility with major CRM platforms could be a technical cause.", "utterranceID": "20260704-2-81a1e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260704-2-81a1e"}
