{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_686130c8", "timestamp": "2027-05-24T13:41:00", "text": "The root cause was that our authentication mechanism didn't implement robust session management practices. Specifically, it lacked session expiration and regeneration, which made it vulnerable to session hijacking.", "utterranceID": "20270524-1-7da79"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270524-1-7da79"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_686130c8", "timestamp": "2027-05-24T13:45:00", "text": "To fix this, I implemented a more secure session management system. Now, sessions are set to expire after a period of inactivity, and session IDs are regenerated upon successful login. This should prevent unauthorized access to private channel summaries.", "utterranceID": "20270524-2-23bab"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270524-2-23bab"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e3c15ff5", "timestamp": "2027-05-24T13:48:00", "text": "Great work, Charlie! Thanks for addressing this so quickly. @eid_686130c8", "utterranceID": "20270524-3-4a5f3"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270524-3-4a5f3"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f4f58faa", "timestamp": "2027-05-24T13:52:00", "text": "Thanks, Charlie. This was a critical issue, and I'm glad it's resolved. I'll review the PR shortly.", "utterranceID": "20270524-4-070c8"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270524-4-070c8"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_686130c8", "timestamp": "2027-05-24T13:54:00", "text": "Thanks, Fiona and David. Let me know if you have any questions or need further clarification on the changes.", "utterranceID": "20270524-5-a71ac"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270524-5-a71ac"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e3c15ff5", "timestamp": "2027-05-26T01:00:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug titled 'Inefficient Event Handling' has been resolved. You can check the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/SummarizeForce/pull/40.", "utterranceID": "20270525-0-876df"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270525-0-876df"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e3c15ff5", "timestamp": "2027-05-26T01:01:00", "text": "The root cause was that event listeners were not properly managed, leading to multiple redundant operations being executed simultaneously, which caused the UI to become sluggish.", "utterranceID": "20270525-1-2d1e8"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270525-1-2d1e8"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e3c15ff5", "timestamp": "2027-05-26T01:05:00", "text": "To fix this, I consolidated the event listeners and ensured that each event triggers only the necessary operations. This optimization should prevent any redundant processing and improve the UI performance.", "utterranceID": "20270525-2-7af30"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270525-2-7af30"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_686130c8", "timestamp": "2027-05-26T01:08:00", "text": "Great work, @eid_e3c15ff5! Thanks for tackling this issue. The sluggishness was really affecting the user experience.", "utterranceID": "20270525-3-68eef"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270525-3-68eef"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f4f58faa", "timestamp": "2027-05-26T01:10:00", "text": "Thanks, Fiona! This should make a big difference. I'll run some tests to ensure everything is smooth now.", "utterranceID": "20270525-4-63467"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270525-4-63467"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e3c15ff5", "timestamp": "2027-05-26T01:14:00", "text": "Thanks, Charlie and David. Let me know if you encounter any further issues during testing.", "utterranceID": "20270525-5-d5747"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270525-5-d5747"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_686130c8", "timestamp": "2027-05-26T01:18:00", "text": "Will do, Fiona. Appreciate the quick turnaround on this!", "utterranceID": "20270525-6-cc616"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270525-6-cc616"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f4f58faa", "timestamp": "2027-05-29T10:23:00", "text": "Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with SummarizeForce that we need to address ASAP. Let's go through them one by one. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20270529-0-2c3be"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270529-0-2c3be"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f4f58faa", "timestamp": "2027-05-29T10:25:00", "text": "First up, we have a concurrency control bottleneck issue. High contention for database resources during concurrent summarization requests is causing increased wait times and reduced throughput. This is impacting our Database & Performance area and affecting customer CUST-0090. @eid_686130c8, can you take this one?", "utterranceID": "20270529-1-1de1b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270529-1-1de1b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_686130c8", "timestamp": "2027-05-29T10:27:00", "text": "Got it! I'll dive into the database performance and see what's causing the bottleneck. Thanks for the heads-up! 👍", "utterranceID": "20270529-2-c4e89"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270529-2-c4e89"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f4f58faa", "timestamp": "2027-05-29T10:31:00", "text": "Thanks, @eid_686130c8! Next, we have an issue with inconsistent tone and style adaptation. The summarizer isn't maintaining the tone and style for non-English conversations, leading to disjointed summaries. This affects our AI Model & Language Processing and impacts customer CUST-0072. @eid_e3c15ff5, can you handle this?", "utterranceID": "20270529-3-42528"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270529-3-42528"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e3c15ff5", "timestamp": "2027-05-29T10:36:00", "text": "Sure thing! I'll look into the language processing models and see why they're not adapting properly. Let's make sure our non-English users get the same quality experience. 🌍", "utterranceID": "20270529-4-6e546"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270529-4-6e546"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f4f58faa", "timestamp": "2027-05-29T10:39:00", "text": "Awesome, thanks! Lastly, there's an issue with delayed summary updates for active conversations. SummarizeForce isn't updating summaries in real-time, which is frustrating users who rely on up-to-date info. This affects Backend Processing & Real-Time Updates and impacts customer CUST-0096. @eid_e3c15ff5, can you also take this one?", "utterranceID": "20270529-5-967bb"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270529-5-967bb"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e3c15ff5", "timestamp": "2027-05-29T10:41:00", "text": "Absolutely, I'll tackle this as well. Real-time updates are crucial, so I'll prioritize getting this fixed. Thanks for assigning it to me! 🔧", "utterranceID": "20270529-6-15824"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270529-6-15824"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f4f58faa", "timestamp": "2027-05-29T10:42:00", "text": "Great, thanks for stepping up, everyone! If you need any more details or run into roadblocks, feel free to reach out. Let's keep our customers happy! 😊", "utterranceID": "20270529-7-4c20f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270529-7-4c20f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_686130c8", "timestamp": "2027-05-29T10:43:00", "text": "Will do! Let's get these issues sorted out. 💪", "utterranceID": "20270529-8-e2e5f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270529-8-e2e5f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e3c15ff5", "timestamp": "2027-05-29T10:45:00", "text": "On it! Thanks for the support, team. Let's make it happen! 🚀", "utterranceID": "20270529-9-9fda8"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270529-9-9fda8"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f4f58faa", "timestamp": "2027-06-06T06:09:00", "text": "Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with SummarizeForce that we need to address. Let's go through them one by one. 😊", "utterranceID": "20270606-0-1ae10"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270606-0-1ae10"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f4f58faa", "timestamp": "2027-06-06T06:11:00", "text": "First up, we have a 'Suboptimal Data Partitioning' issue. The system is experiencing slowdowns due to inefficient data partitioning, affecting the performance of distributed queries across database shards. This impacts the Database & Performance area, causing slow response times for users, which can hinder productivity. Impacted customer: CUST-0053. @eid_4812cbd8, this one's for you.", "utterranceID": "20270606-1-bcc61"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270606-1-bcc61"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4812cbd8", "timestamp": "2027-06-06T06:13:00", "text": "Got it! I'll dive into the data partitioning issue and see how we can optimize it to improve performance. Thanks for the heads-up! 🚀", "utterranceID": "20270606-2-37ef3"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270606-2-37ef3"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f4f58faa", "timestamp": "2027-06-06T06:16:00", "text": "Great, thanks! Next, we have an 'Excessive Client-Side Computation' issue. The client-side is performing heavy computation for summarizing conversations, making the UI unresponsive. This affects the User Interface & Client-Side Processing area, interrupting users' workflow. Impacted customer: CUST-0082. @eid_4812cbd8, you're up again!", "utterranceID": "20270606-3-e71a5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270606-3-e71a5"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4812cbd8", "timestamp": "2027-06-06T06:20:00", "text": "Understood! I'll work on optimizing the client-side processing to ensure the UI remains responsive. Let's keep our users happy! 😄", "utterranceID": "20270606-4-892ba"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270606-4-892ba"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f4f58faa", "timestamp": "2027-06-06T06:22:00", "text": "Awesome, thanks! Lastly, we have a 'Concurrency Handling Flaw'. SummarizeForce is generating summaries based on incomplete data when multiple updates occur simultaneously in a Slack channel. This affects Backend Processing & Real-Time Updates, leading to outdated summaries and user frustration. Impacted customer: CUST-0030. @eid_4812cbd8, this one's also for you.", "utterranceID": "20270606-5-7327e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270606-5-7327e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4812cbd8", "timestamp": "2027-06-06T06:23:00", "text": "I'll take care of the concurrency issue as well. Ensuring accurate and timely summaries is crucial. Let's get this sorted out! 💪", "utterranceID": "20270606-6-8de80"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270606-6-8de80"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f4f58faa", "timestamp": "2027-06-06T06:27:00", "text": "Thanks, @eid_4812cbd8, for taking on these issues. If anyone has questions or needs more context, feel free to ask. Let's keep the communication open and tackle these challenges together! 🙌", "utterranceID": "20270606-7-f81f2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270606-7-f81f2"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4812cbd8", "timestamp": "2027-06-06T06:31:00", "text": "No problem! If I need any additional info, I'll reach out. Let's make sure our customers have the best experience possible. 👍", "utterranceID": "20270606-8-a916d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270606-8-a916d"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e3c15ff5", "timestamp": "2027-06-18T17:40:00", "text": "Hi team, I looked into the reported issue about the delayed summary updates for active conversations.", "utterranceID": "20270618-0-e3a63"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270618-0-e3a63"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e3c15ff5", "timestamp": "2027-06-18T17:43:00", "text": "The issue is that SummarizeForce doesn't update summaries in real-time, which was initially thought to be a bug.", "utterranceID": "20270618-1-2fadb"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270618-1-2fadb"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e3c15ff5", "timestamp": "2027-06-18T17:46:00", "text": "After reviewing the system's design and functionality, it turns out this behavior is actually expected.", "utterranceID": "20270618-2-8e287"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270618-2-8e287"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_686130c8", "timestamp": "2027-06-18T17:48:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, Fiona. Can you explain why it's expected behavior?", "utterranceID": "20270618-3-ada6d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270618-3-ada6d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e3c15ff5", "timestamp": "2027-06-18T17:52:00", "text": "Sure, Charlie. The system uses a polling mechanism that intentionally introduces a delay to reduce server load and optimize performance.", "utterranceID": "20270618-4-ac774"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270618-4-ac774"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e3c15ff5", "timestamp": "2027-06-18T17:54:00", "text": "Real-time updates would require a significant increase in resource allocation, which isn't feasible with our current infrastructure.", "utterranceID": "20270618-5-2e655"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270618-5-2e655"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f4f58faa", "timestamp": "2027-06-18T17:57:00", "text": "Got it, Fiona. So, it's more about balancing performance and resource usage?", "utterranceID": "20270618-6-ce278"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270618-6-ce278"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e3c15ff5", "timestamp": "2027-06-18T18:02:00", "text": "Exactly, @eid_f4f58faa. We did a thorough review of the backend processing pipeline and confirmed that the latency is within acceptable limits.", "utterranceID": "20270618-7-72852"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270618-7-72852"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_686130c8", "timestamp": "2027-06-18T18:04:00", "text": "Thanks for clarifying, Fiona. It's good to know that it's not a bug but a design choice.", "utterranceID": "20270618-8-4e0ac"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270618-8-4e0ac"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e3c15ff5", "timestamp": "2027-06-18T18:07:00", "text": "No problem, Charlie. If there are any further questions or concerns, feel free to reach out!", "utterranceID": "20270618-9-b948e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270618-9-b948e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_686130c8", "timestamp": "2027-06-19T23:50:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug titled 'Concurrency Control Bottlenecks' has been resolved. You can check the details in the PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/SummarizeForce/pull/43.", "utterranceID": "20270619-0-7d50b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270619-0-7d50b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_686130c8", "timestamp": "2027-06-19T23:53:00", "text": "The root cause was identified as the database's concurrency control mechanisms not being optimized for high levels of parallelism. This was causing high contention for resources during concurrent summarization requests, leading to increased wait times and reduced throughput.", "utterranceID": "20270619-1-32569"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270619-1-32569"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_686130c8", "timestamp": "2027-06-19T23:57:00", "text": "To resolve this, we implemented a more granular locking strategy and optimized the use of latches to better handle simultaneous requests. This should significantly reduce wait times and improve overall throughput.", "utterranceID": "20270619-2-62423"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270619-2-62423"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e3c15ff5", "timestamp": "2027-06-19T23:59:00", "text": "Great work, Charlie! Thanks for the update. I'll run some tests to verify the improvements.", "utterranceID": "20270619-3-e343b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270619-3-e343b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f4f58faa", "timestamp": "2027-06-20T00:00:00", "text": "Thanks, @eid_686130c8. This should really help with the performance issues we've been seeing. Let me know if you need any assistance with further testing.", "utterranceID": "20270619-4-5213c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270619-4-5213c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_686130c8", "timestamp": "2027-06-20T00:03:00", "text": "Thanks, Fiona and David. Please let me know if you encounter any issues during testing. I'm here to help!", "utterranceID": "20270619-5-e1e01"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270619-5-e1e01"}

