{"Channel": {"name": "develop-hannahmartinez-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-480d07"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_7f22371d", "timestamp": "2026-09-07T01:23:00", "text": "That's a valid point. @eid_6f719d21, could you provide more details on the testing process for these new methods? Were there any known issues during testing?", "utterranceID": "20260906-3-50e44"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260906-3-50e44"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-hannahmartinez-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-480d07"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6f719d21", "timestamp": "2026-09-07T01:25:00", "text": "Sure, the new methods were tested in our standard environment, but we didn't have the resources to simulate a full quantum attack scenario. We focused on current known vulnerabilities.", "utterranceID": "20260906-4-196b2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260906-4-196b2"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-hannahmartinez-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-480d07"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_061285c7", "timestamp": "2026-09-07T01:28:00", "text": "It sounds like we might need a more comprehensive testing approach. @eid_ea95d983 and @eid_84b3cc1f, what do you think about the approval process? Were these risks considered?", "utterranceID": "20260906-5-066aa"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260906-5-066aa"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-hannahmartinez-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-480d07"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ea95d983", "timestamp": "2026-09-07T01:33:00", "text": "We approved based on the information available at the time. The focus was on enhancing security, but it seems like the quantum aspect might need more attention.", "utterranceID": "20260906-6-5da61"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260906-6-5da61"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-hannahmartinez-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-480d07"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_84b3cc1f", "timestamp": "2026-09-07T01:34:00", "text": "Agreed. We should have flagged the quantum compatibility as a separate concern. I think it's prudent to consider reverting until we can address these issues.", "utterranceID": "20260906-7-6882d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260906-7-6882d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-hannahmartinez-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-480d07"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_7f22371d", "timestamp": "2026-09-07T01:35:00", "text": "I support reverting it for now. We can't risk introducing vulnerabilities, especially with quantum computing on the horizon.", "utterranceID": "20260906-8-77077"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260906-8-77077"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-hannahmartinez-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-480d07"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_0719bc3e", "timestamp": "2026-09-07T01:40:00", "text": "Same here. Let's revert and reassess the encryption methods with a focus on quantum threats.", "utterranceID": "20260906-9-5370e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260906-9-5370e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-hannahmartinez-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-480d07"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9c46088d", "timestamp": "2026-09-07T01:41:00", "text": "Alright, @eid_6f719d21, could you please revert PR# 13? We need to ensure our systems remain secure while we address these concerns.", "utterranceID": "20260906-10-29ad3"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260906-10-29ad3"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-hannahmartinez-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-480d07"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6f719d21", "timestamp": "2026-09-07T01:44:00", "text": "Understood. I'll start the process to revert the PR and will coordinate with the team to address the identified issues. Thanks for bringing this to my attention.", "utterranceID": "20260906-11-d60f4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260906-11-d60f4"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-hannahmartinez-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-480d07"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6f719d21", "timestamp": "2026-09-07T11:26:00", "text": "https://github.com/salesforce/ATF_AIX/pull/16", "utterranceID": "20260907-0-7a8ea"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260907-0-7a8ea"}
