{"Channel": {"name": "develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-de9cfb"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_01e37306", "timestamp": "2026-11-02T15:02:00", "text": "Agreed. Can someone clarify what the new product direction is and why this PR might not fit anymore?", "utterranceID": "20261102-2-3b874"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261102-2-3b874"}
