{"Channel": {"name": "develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-de9cfb"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b7a6e7f9", "timestamp": "2026-11-02T15:16:00", "text": "Agreed. Let's hold off on merging until we have a clearer need for these tools.", "utterranceID": "20261102-8-3b7d6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261102-8-3b7d6"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-de9cfb"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a7dd9c52", "timestamp": "2026-11-02T15:18:00", "text": "Got it, I'll hold off on merging the PR. If there's any change or further discussion needed, just let me know.", "utterranceID": "20261102-9-fde95"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261102-9-fde95"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-de9cfb"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_73a50f06", "timestamp": "2026-11-02T15:23:00", "text": "Thanks, @eid_a7dd9c52. Let's keep communication open in case priorities shift again.", "utterranceID": "20261102-10-b7e5f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261102-10-b7e5f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-de9cfb"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f6c32cc2", "timestamp": "2026-11-03T05:06:00", "text": "Hi team, I wanted to bring up PR# 36. It was approved and merged, but there's been a change in product direction, and I'm wondering if we should consider reverting it.", "utterranceID": "20261102-0-cd4b4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261102-0-cd4b4"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-de9cfb"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8cbee5b3", "timestamp": "2026-11-03T05:10:00", "text": "Thanks for raising this, @eid_f6c32cc2. Can someone clarify what the new product direction is and why the GraphQL integration is no longer necessary?", "utterranceID": "20261102-1-50114"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261102-1-50114"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-de9cfb"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_839e5084", "timestamp": "2026-11-03T05:13:00", "text": "From what I understand, the focus has shifted towards enhancing our REST API instead of moving forward with GraphQL. The integration might not align with our current goals.", "utterranceID": "20261102-2-0b032"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261102-2-0b032"}
