{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-d1c875"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b7702c98", "timestamp": "2026-12-09T14:06:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug about incorrect data being served due to data replication lag has been resolved. You can check the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/ForecastForce/pull/41.", "utterranceID": "20261209-0-57529"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261209-0-57529"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-d1c875"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_57e922c4", "timestamp": "2026-12-09T14:08:00", "text": "That's great news, Bob! Can you explain what was causing the lag?", "utterranceID": "20261209-1-792ae"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261209-1-792ae"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-d1c875"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b7702c98", "timestamp": "2026-12-09T14:10:00", "text": "Sure, Alice. The root cause was network latency and insufficient bandwidth allocation, which were delaying the synchronization of forecast data between the primary and secondary database nodes.", "utterranceID": "20261209-2-9e500"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261209-2-9e500"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-d1c875"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_bd791efc", "timestamp": "2026-12-09T14:15:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, Bob. How did you manage to fix it?", "utterranceID": "20261209-3-fd5f1"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261209-3-fd5f1"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-d1c875"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b7702c98", "timestamp": "2026-12-09T14:17:00", "text": "To resolve the issue, I optimized the network configuration to prioritize replication traffic and increased the bandwidth allocation for the replication process. This ensures that the data syncs more efficiently and reduces the lag significantly.", "utterranceID": "20261209-4-d1b3d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261209-4-d1b3d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-d1c875"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_57e922c4", "timestamp": "2026-12-09T14:20:00", "text": "Nice work, @eid_b7702c98! This should improve the user experience a lot.", "utterranceID": "20261209-5-e4ee5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261209-5-e4ee5"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce", "channelID": "ch-force-d1c875"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_bd791efc", "timestamp": "2026-12-09T14:21:00", "text": "Absolutely, thanks for handling this so quickly, Bob. Let me know if there's anything else you need from us.", "utterranceID": "20261209-6-2360f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261209-6-2360f"}
