{"Channel": {"name": "bug-bobdavis-PersonalizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-cdb98a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_eed289d3", "timestamp": "2026-12-01T04:07:00", "text": "To address the issue, we implemented a data augmentation strategy to balance the training dataset. Additionally, we incorporated fairness constraints during the model training process to ensure more equitable recommendations. This should help mitigate the bias and improve the model's performance.", "utterranceID": "20261130-4-18fdc"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261130-4-18fdc"}
