{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f603c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8df92d08", "timestamp": "2026-12-31T21:20:00", "text": "First up, we have an issue titled 'Inconsistent Layout Across Mobile Browsers'. The layout appears differently across various mobile browsers, which is causing confusion for our mobile users. This affects the User Interface & Mobile Compatibility. Impacted customer is CUST-0018. @eid_e4d35074, can you take this one?", "utterranceID": "20261231-1-309d8"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261231-1-309d8"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f603c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e4d35074", "timestamp": "2026-12-31T21:23:00", "text": "Got it! I'll start looking into the mobile layout inconsistencies right away. Thanks for the heads-up! 📱", "utterranceID": "20261231-2-a3fec"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261231-2-a3fec"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f603c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8df92d08", "timestamp": "2026-12-31T21:26:00", "text": "Great, thanks! Next, we have a 'Cross-Origin Resource Sharing (CORS) Misconfiguration'. The API's CORS policy is too permissive, which could expose sensitive customer data. This is a critical issue affecting API Security & Access Control. Impacted customer is CUST-0094. @eid_7687dbe6, can you handle this?", "utterranceID": "20261231-3-bc6f6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261231-3-bc6f6"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f603c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_7687dbe6", "timestamp": "2026-12-31T21:31:00", "text": "Absolutely, I'll tighten up the CORS policy to ensure our data is secure. Thanks for flagging this! 🔒", "utterranceID": "20261231-4-c03d9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261231-4-c03d9"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f603c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8df92d08", "timestamp": "2026-12-31T21:34:00", "text": "Thanks, @eid_7687dbe6! Lastly, there's a 'Slow Response Time During Peak Usage'. Users are experiencing delays in generating sales pitches during high traffic periods, impacting Backend Infrastructure & Performance. Impacted customer is CUST-0034. @eid_e4d35074, can you also take this one?", "utterranceID": "20261231-5-df373"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261231-5-df373"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f603c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e4d35074", "timestamp": "2026-12-31T21:37:00", "text": "Sure thing! I'll dive into the performance issues and see how we can optimize the backend for peak times. 🏃‍♂️", "utterranceID": "20261231-6-be1f4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261231-6-be1f4"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f603c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8df92d08", "timestamp": "2026-12-31T21:40:00", "text": "Awesome, thanks everyone for jumping on these issues so quickly. Let me know if you need any more details or support. Let's get these resolved and keep our customers happy! 😊", "utterranceID": "20261231-7-3c687"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261231-7-3c687"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliagarcia-PitchForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f603c3"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_7687dbe6", "timestamp": "2026-12-31T21:44:00", "text": "Will do! Thanks for coordinating, @eid_8df92d08. 👍", "utterranceID": "20261231-8-2554d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261231-8-2554d"}
