{"Channel": {"name": "bug-hannahsmith-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-1162dc"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_16935c12", "timestamp": "2027-03-04T17:29:00", "text": "First up, we have the 'AI Suggestion Overload' issue. The AI-powered suggestion engine is generating too many data point recommendations, which is overwhelming the Visualization Module. This is causing delays and disrupting discussions for Customer CUST-0084. @eid_4d18a84c, can you take this one?", "utterranceID": "20270304-1-ed776"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270304-1-ed776"}
