{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionabrown-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-ae9183"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_67036b20", "timestamp": "2027-01-11T01:53:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug titled 'Failure to Adapt to User Feedback' has been resolved. You can check out the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/CollaborateForce/pull/56.", "utterranceID": "20270110-0-f420a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270110-0-f420a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionabrown-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-ae9183"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_67036b20", "timestamp": "2027-01-11T01:57:00", "text": "The root cause was a malfunction in the feedback loop mechanism. Specifically, there was a bug in the reinforcement learning component that prevented the system from updating its recommendation strategy based on user interactions.", "utterranceID": "20270110-1-46889"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270110-1-46889"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionabrown-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-ae9183"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_67036b20", "timestamp": "2027-01-11T01:59:00", "text": "To fix this, I adjusted the feedback loop to correctly process user feedback and update the model weights accordingly. This ensures that the AI Suggestion Engine now learns effectively from user inputs and avoids repeating previously rejected suggestions.", "utterranceID": "20270110-2-dfc8f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270110-2-dfc8f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionabrown-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-ae9183"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ab6f41bc", "timestamp": "2027-01-11T02:03:00", "text": "Great work, @eid_67036b20! Thanks for resolving this so quickly. This should improve user satisfaction significantly.", "utterranceID": "20270110-3-f57cf"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270110-3-f57cf"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionabrown-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-ae9183"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_7fba1318", "timestamp": "2027-01-11T02:04:00", "text": "Thanks, Alice! Can you confirm if there are any additional tests we need to run to ensure everything is working as expected?", "utterranceID": "20270110-4-9f16d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270110-4-9f16d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionabrown-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-ae9183"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_67036b20", "timestamp": "2027-01-11T02:09:00", "text": "Hi Fiona Davis, I've already run a comprehensive set of tests, and everything looks good. However, it would be great if the QA team could do a final round of testing to double-check.", "utterranceID": "20270110-5-42863"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270110-5-42863"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionabrown-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-ae9183"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ab6f41bc", "timestamp": "2027-01-11T02:13:00", "text": "We'll get on that right away. Thanks again, Alice!", "utterranceID": "20270110-6-094a5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270110-6-094a5"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionadavis-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-8ea87e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "slack_admin_bot", "timestamp": "2026-12-10T00:03:00", "text": "@eid_131494b8 created this channel on 2026-12-10 00:03:00. This is the very beginning of the bug-fionadavis-CollaborateForce channel.", "utterranceID": "20261210-0-2117b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261210-0-2117b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionadavis-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-8ea87e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "slack_admin_bot", "timestamp": "2026-12-10T00:03:00", "text": "@eid_131494b8 joined bug-fionadavis-CollaborateForce. Also, @eid_70223d0a, @eid_63ea0ec4, @eid_69130545, @eid_2594f98a, @eid_8986ddc3 joined via invite.", "utterranceID": "20261210-1-1d9c2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261210-1-1d9c2"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionadavis-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-8ea87e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_131494b8", "timestamp": "2026-12-10T05:16:00", "text": "Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with CollaborateForce that we need to address. Let's go through them one by one. 😊", "utterranceID": "20261210-0-3799f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261210-0-3799f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionadavis-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-8ea87e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_131494b8", "timestamp": "2026-12-10T05:17:00", "text": "First up, we have a 'Data Fetch Bottleneck' issue. During peak usage times, the system experiences delays in fetching data from the database, causing slow response times in updating visualizations. This affects the Backend Server and impacts customer CUST-0026. @eid_2594f98a, this one's for you.", "utterranceID": "20261210-1-660a0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261210-1-660a0"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionadavis-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-8ea87e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2594f98a", "timestamp": "2026-12-10T05:18:00", "text": "Got it! I'll start looking into the data fetch bottleneck issue right away. Thanks for the heads-up! 🚀", "utterranceID": "20261210-2-b5e20"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261210-2-b5e20"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionadavis-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-8ea87e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_131494b8", "timestamp": "2026-12-10T05:22:00", "text": "Great, thanks! Next, we have an 'API Authentication Failure'. There are intermittent failures when external applications attempt to authenticate with the CollaborateForce API, which affects the API Authentication Layer. This is impacting customer CUST-0085. @eid_70223d0a, can you take this one?", "utterranceID": "20261210-3-c2da4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261210-3-c2da4"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionadavis-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-8ea87e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_70223d0a", "timestamp": "2026-12-10T05:23:00", "text": "Sure thing! I'll dive into the API authentication failure and see what's causing these hiccups. 🔍", "utterranceID": "20261210-4-a4763"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261210-4-a4763"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionadavis-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-8ea87e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_131494b8", "timestamp": "2026-12-10T05:26:00", "text": "Awesome, thanks! Lastly, there's a 'JWT Signature Verification Error'. External applications are encountering signature verification errors when trying to authenticate using JSON Web Tokens. This also affects the API Authentication Layer and impacts customer CUST-0094. @eid_8986ddc3, can you handle this?", "utterranceID": "20261210-5-83ac0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261210-5-83ac0"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionadavis-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-8ea87e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8986ddc3", "timestamp": "2026-12-10T05:28:00", "text": "Absolutely, I'll investigate the JWT signature verification error and get it sorted out. 🛠️", "utterranceID": "20261210-6-ea37a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261210-6-ea37a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionadavis-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-8ea87e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_131494b8", "timestamp": "2026-12-10T05:29:00", "text": "Thanks, everyone! Let's keep the communication open. If you need any additional info or run into roadblocks, just shout. 🙌", "utterranceID": "20261210-7-b0326"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261210-7-b0326"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionadavis-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-8ea87e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2594f98a", "timestamp": "2026-12-10T05:33:00", "text": "Will do! I'll update you all once I have more details on the bottleneck issue. 👍", "utterranceID": "20261210-8-e5229"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261210-8-e5229"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionadavis-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-8ea87e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_70223d0a", "timestamp": "2026-12-10T05:35:00", "text": "Same here, I'll keep you posted on the API issue progress. 🤞", "utterranceID": "20261210-9-1d183"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261210-9-1d183"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionadavis-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-8ea87e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8986ddc3", "timestamp": "2026-12-10T05:40:00", "text": "Count on me to share updates on the JWT error as well. Let's get these sorted! 💪", "utterranceID": "20261210-10-5910a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261210-10-5910a"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-bobbrown-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-a5e3e1"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_86f94a48", "timestamp": "2027-03-22T01:25:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug about incorrect token expiry times, titled 'Token Expiry Mismatch', has been resolved. You can check the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/CollaborateForce/pull/67.", "utterranceID": "20270321-0-eebe2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270321-0-eebe2"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-bobbrown-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-a5e3e1"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_86f94a48", "timestamp": "2027-03-22T01:29:00", "text": "The root cause was a discrepancy between the token expiry time set in our CollaborateForce API and the expiry time recognized by external applications. This was due to incorrect time zone handling.", "utterranceID": "20270321-1-8a162"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270321-1-8a162"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-bobbrown-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-a5e3e1"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_86f94a48", "timestamp": "2027-03-22T01:34:00", "text": "To fix this, I updated the API to standardize all token expiry times to UTC. Additionally, I added a conversion utility to ensure that any time zone differences are correctly handled before tokens are issued.", "utterranceID": "20270321-2-48f8c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270321-2-48f8c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-bobbrown-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-a5e3e1"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d3a4fc8f", "timestamp": "2027-03-22T01:36:00", "text": "Great work, @eid_86f94a48! Thanks for jumping on this so quickly. This should help reduce those authentication failures we've been seeing.", "utterranceID": "20270321-3-cd414"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270321-3-cd414"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-bobbrown-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-a5e3e1"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_86f94a48", "timestamp": "2027-03-22T01:37:00", "text": "Thanks, Bob Brown! If anyone notices any further issues or has questions, feel free to reach out.", "utterranceID": "20270321-4-67032"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270321-4-67032"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-bobbrown-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-a5e3e1"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_86f94a48", "timestamp": "2027-03-25T06:35:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug titled 'Cross-Site Scripting (XSS) Flaw' has been resolved. You can check the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/CollaborateForce/pull/68.", "utterranceID": "20270325-0-880b5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270325-0-880b5"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-bobbrown-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-a5e3e1"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_86f94a48", "timestamp": "2027-03-25T06:39:00", "text": "The root cause was that our security module wasn't adequately sanitizing user inputs in the CollaborateForce feature, which allowed script injection.", "utterranceID": "20270325-1-fdd2d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270325-1-fdd2d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-bobbrown-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-a5e3e1"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_86f94a48", "timestamp": "2027-03-25T06:43:00", "text": "To fix this, I implemented a stricter input validation process that escapes potentially harmful characters before they are processed. This should prevent any malicious scripts from being injected.", "utterranceID": "20270325-2-72b5d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270325-2-72b5d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-bobbrown-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-a5e3e1"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d3a4fc8f", "timestamp": "2027-03-25T06:46:00", "text": "@eid_86f94a48 Great job, Bob Martinez! Thanks for addressing this so quickly.", "utterranceID": "20270325-3-9c6c8"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270325-3-9c6c8"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-bobbrown-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-a5e3e1"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d3a4fc8f", "timestamp": "2027-03-25T06:47:00", "text": "This fix will definitely enhance our security posture. I'll make sure to update the team on the changes.", "utterranceID": "20270325-4-b07fd"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270325-4-b07fd"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-bobbrown-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-a5e3e1"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_86f94a48", "timestamp": "2027-03-25T06:49:00", "text": "Thanks, Bob Brown. Please let me know if there's anything else that needs attention or if further testing is required.", "utterranceID": "20270325-5-101dd"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270325-5-101dd"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-bobbrown-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-a5e3e1"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d3a4fc8f", "timestamp": "2027-03-25T06:54:00", "text": "Will do, Bob Martinez. Let's keep an eye on the logs for any unusual activity just in case.", "utterranceID": "20270325-6-2af35"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270325-6-2af35"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionadavis-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-8ea87e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8986ddc3", "timestamp": "2026-12-16T03:35:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug about incorrect JWT signature verification has been resolved. 🎉", "utterranceID": "20261216-0-470eb"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261216-0-470eb"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionadavis-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-8ea87e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8986ddc3", "timestamp": "2026-12-16T03:39:00", "text": "The issue was due to an outdated cryptographic library in the CollaborateForce API. It couldn't correctly verify JWT signatures generated by external applications.", "utterranceID": "20261216-1-e9a8c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261216-1-e9a8c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionadavis-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-8ea87e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8986ddc3", "timestamp": "2026-12-16T03:41:00", "text": "I've updated the library to the latest version, which supports the necessary cryptographic algorithms for proper JWT verification. You can check the details in the PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/CollaborateForce/pull/52", "utterranceID": "20261216-2-c566e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261216-2-c566e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionadavis-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-8ea87e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_131494b8", "timestamp": "2026-12-16T03:45:00", "text": "Great work, @eid_8986ddc3! Thanks for jumping on this so quickly. Does this update require any changes on the client side?", "utterranceID": "20261216-3-16fe8"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261216-3-16fe8"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionadavis-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-8ea87e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8986ddc3", "timestamp": "2026-12-16T03:50:00", "text": "Thanks, Fiona! No changes are needed on the client side. The update is backward compatible, so everything should work seamlessly.", "utterranceID": "20261216-4-2a041"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261216-4-2a041"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionadavis-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-8ea87e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_70223d0a", "timestamp": "2026-12-16T03:52:00", "text": "Thanks, Alice. I'll notify the external partners about the fix. This should resolve the authentication issues they've been facing.", "utterranceID": "20261216-5-c7e59"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261216-5-c7e59"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionadavis-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-8ea87e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2594f98a", "timestamp": "2026-12-16T03:53:00", "text": "Awesome job, Alice! I'll keep an eye on the logs to ensure everything is running smoothly post-update.", "utterranceID": "20261216-6-1bf2a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261216-6-1bf2a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-fionadavis-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-8ea87e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8986ddc3", "timestamp": "2026-12-16T03:56:00", "text": "Thanks, @eid_70223d0a and @eid_2594f98a. Let me know if you notice anything unusual. Otherwise, we should be all set!", "utterranceID": "20261216-7-0a4e5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261216-7-0a4e5"}

{"Channel": {"name": "planning-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-abaix-c92927"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_16935c12", "timestamp": "2026-06-15T23:55:00", "text": "Hi team, I was reading about DataSync Pro and thought it would be useful to discuss its strengths and weaknesses. One major issue is its limited support for non-English languages, which could be a barrier for international users. Additionally, it has a higher learning curve for those new to data analytics.", "utterranceID": "20260916-0-1b08d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260916-0-1b08d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-abaix-c92927"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4988ee2a", "timestamp": "2026-06-15T23:56:00", "text": "Thanks for bringing this up, @eid_16935c12! 🌟 How does the language limitation affect user experience? Is it just the interface, or does it extend to documentation and support as well?", "utterranceID": "20260916-1-b0d28"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260916-1-b0d28"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-abaix-c92927"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_16935c12", "timestamp": "2026-06-15T23:59:00", "text": "Great question, Emma. The limitation is primarily in the interface and some of the documentation. Support is also mostly in English, which can be a challenge for non-English speaking users.", "utterranceID": "20260916-2-b095a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260916-2-b095a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-abaix-c92927"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b7a6e7f9", "timestamp": "2026-06-16T00:02:00", "text": "That sounds like a significant hurdle for global adoption. 🤔 How steep is the learning curve, Hannah? Are there specific features that are particularly challenging?", "utterranceID": "20260916-3-ca21a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260916-3-ca21a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-abaix-c92927"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_16935c12", "timestamp": "2026-06-16T00:05:00", "text": "The learning curve is quite steep, especially for users who aren't familiar with data analytics tools. The interface isn't very intuitive, and some advanced features require a deep understanding of data processes.", "utterranceID": "20260916-4-dbcaa"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260916-4-dbcaa"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-abaix-c92927"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d3a4fc8f", "timestamp": "2026-06-16T00:06:00", "text": "Interesting. @eid_16935c12, do they offer any training or onboarding resources to help new users get up to speed?", "utterranceID": "20260916-5-37bb4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260916-5-37bb4"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-abaix-c92927"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_16935c12", "timestamp": "2026-06-16T00:09:00", "text": "They do offer some online tutorials and webinars, but feedback suggests that these resources aren't comprehensive enough for beginners.", "utterranceID": "20260916-6-bcd38"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260916-6-bcd38"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-abaix-c92927"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_0c373165", "timestamp": "2026-06-16T00:12:00", "text": "Sounds like there's an opportunity for us to differentiate with better user support and a more intuitive design. 💡", "utterranceID": "20260916-7-a8153"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260916-7-a8153"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-abaix-c92927"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4988ee2a", "timestamp": "2026-06-16T00:15:00", "text": "Absolutely, George. We should definitely focus on making our product more accessible and user-friendly. 😊", "utterranceID": "20260916-8-6e630"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260916-8-6e630"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-abaix-c92927"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b7a6e7f9", "timestamp": "2026-06-16T00:16:00", "text": "Agreed! Maybe we can conduct some user testing to identify areas where we can improve our onboarding process.", "utterranceID": "20260916-9-039b9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260916-9-039b9"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-abaix-c92927"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d3a4fc8f", "timestamp": "2026-06-16T00:20:00", "text": "I can help coordinate that. Let's make sure our product stands out by being easy to use and accessible to a global audience. 🌍", "utterranceID": "20260916-10-8cd02"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260916-10-8cd02"}
