{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a23a73c4", "timestamp": "2026-09-07T00:04:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug about incorrect load balancing in front of the API Gateway has been resolved. You can check the details in the PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/LeadForce/pull/45.", "utterranceID": "20260906-0-6e5df"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260906-0-6e5df"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a23a73c4", "timestamp": "2026-09-07T00:09:00", "text": "The issue was due to the load balancing algorithm not being properly tuned to handle the dynamic nature of lead data requests. This was causing some servers to become overloaded while others were underutilized.", "utterranceID": "20260906-1-2bad4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260906-1-2bad4"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a23a73c4", "timestamp": "2026-09-07T00:14:00", "text": "To fix this, I adjusted the algorithm to use a weighted round-robin approach, which better distributes the requests based on current server load and capacity. This should ensure more even distribution and efficient resource utilization.", "utterranceID": "20260906-2-88368"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260906-2-88368"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f98d7490", "timestamp": "2026-09-07T00:19:00", "text": "Great work, Bob! Thanks for jumping on this so quickly. I'll monitor the system to ensure everything is running smoothly.", "utterranceID": "20260906-3-e243e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260906-3-e243e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a43a4389", "timestamp": "2026-09-07T00:23:00", "text": "Thanks, @eid_a23a73c4! This should help improve our response times significantly. Let me know if there's anything else you need from the DevOps side.", "utterranceID": "20260906-4-58381"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260906-4-58381"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_207da0e7", "timestamp": "2026-09-07T00:27:00", "text": "Awesome job, Bob. I'll update the documentation to reflect the changes in the load balancing strategy.", "utterranceID": "20260906-5-ac542"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260906-5-ac542"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a23a73c4", "timestamp": "2026-09-07T00:31:00", "text": "Thanks, everyone! Let me know if you notice any issues or need further adjustments.", "utterranceID": "20260906-6-15b23"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260906-6-15b23"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_cac9a0ac", "timestamp": "2026-10-18T16:18:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug titled 'Data Serialization Bottleneck' has been resolved. You can check the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/LeadForce/pull/48.", "utterranceID": "20261018-0-90780"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261018-0-90780"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f98d7490", "timestamp": "2026-10-18T16:20:00", "text": "Great news, David! Can you remind us what the root cause was?", "utterranceID": "20261018-1-3021f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261018-1-3021f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_cac9a0ac", "timestamp": "2026-10-18T16:23:00", "text": "Sure, Ian. The root cause was an outdated serialization library that wasn't optimized for the complex data structures we use in LeadForce. This was causing slow data processing and delays in data transmission.", "utterranceID": "20261018-2-0dbb5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261018-2-0dbb5"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a23a73c4", "timestamp": "2026-10-18T16:24:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, David. How did you manage to fix it?", "utterranceID": "20261018-3-dd8c3"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261018-3-dd8c3"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_cac9a0ac", "timestamp": "2026-10-18T16:26:00", "text": "We updated the serialization library to a more recent version that supports our complex data structures more efficiently. Additionally, I refactored some of the data handling logic to better align with the new library's capabilities. This significantly improved the serialization speed.", "utterranceID": "20261018-4-7776f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261018-4-7776f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_207da0e7", "timestamp": "2026-10-18T16:29:00", "text": "Awesome work, @eid_cac9a0ac! This should really help with the performance issues we've been seeing.", "utterranceID": "20261018-5-49ee4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261018-5-49ee4"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_cac9a0ac", "timestamp": "2026-10-18T16:33:00", "text": "Thanks, @eid_207da0e7! Let me know if you notice any further issues or if there's anything else that needs attention.", "utterranceID": "20261018-6-255a5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261018-6-255a5"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a23a73c4", "timestamp": "2026-10-18T16:37:00", "text": "Will do, David. Thanks again for the quick turnaround on this!", "utterranceID": "20261018-7-11435"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261018-7-11435"}

