{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_652e8cd0", "timestamp": "2026-11-17T16:12:00", "text": "Thanks, Ian and Hannah. @eid_99835861, I'll keep you posted if anything comes up during further testing.", "utterranceID": "20261117-6-b741f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261117-6-b741f"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a43a4389", "timestamp": "2026-10-27T10:14:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug about incorrect caching in the API Gateway has been resolved. The issue was with the caching layer inconsistencies, which occasionally served stale lead data. You can check the details in the PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/LeadForce/pull/51.", "utterranceID": "20261027-0-55a29"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261027-0-55a29"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_cac9a0ac", "timestamp": "2026-10-27T10:16:00", "text": "Great news, @eid_a43a4389! What was causing the cache to serve outdated data?", "utterranceID": "20261027-1-3d2ee"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261027-1-3d2ee"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a43a4389", "timestamp": "2026-10-27T10:17:00", "text": "The root cause was that the cache invalidation logic wasn't triggering correctly on certain lead data updates. This led to the cache serving outdated information.", "utterranceID": "20261027-2-ef8ed"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261027-2-ef8ed"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f98d7490", "timestamp": "2026-10-27T10:18:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, Fiona. How did you manage to fix it?", "utterranceID": "20261027-3-592db"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261027-3-592db"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a43a4389", "timestamp": "2026-10-27T10:19:00", "text": "I updated the cache invalidation policies to ensure they trigger on all relevant lead data updates. Specifically, I added hooks to the update functions that now correctly flag the cache for invalidation whenever lead data changes.", "utterranceID": "20261027-4-a6d22"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261027-4-a6d22"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a23a73c4", "timestamp": "2026-10-27T10:21:00", "text": "Nice work, Fiona! This should improve the user experience significantly. Thanks for handling it so quickly.", "utterranceID": "20261027-5-3053d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261027-5-3053d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a43a4389", "timestamp": "2026-10-27T10:26:00", "text": "Thanks, Bob! If anyone notices any further issues, please let me know. Otherwise, we should be good to go.", "utterranceID": "20261027-6-83a0a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261027-6-83a0a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_cac9a0ac", "timestamp": "2026-10-27T10:28:00", "text": "Will do, Fiona. Thanks again for the swift resolution!", "utterranceID": "20261027-7-8a0ee"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261027-7-8a0ee"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a43a4389", "timestamp": "2026-11-01T01:52:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug about incorrect lead scoring due to data mismatch has been resolved. You can check the details in the PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/LeadForce/pull/52.", "utterranceID": "20261031-0-cb67e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261031-0-cb67e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a43a4389", "timestamp": "2026-11-01T01:56:00", "text": "The root cause was an outdated data mapping configuration that didn't align with the recent updates in our data schema.", "utterranceID": "20261031-1-e3d57"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261031-1-e3d57"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_90359c89", "timestamp": "2026-11-01T02:00:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, Fiona! Can you explain how you fixed it?", "utterranceID": "20261031-2-72b31"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261031-2-72b31"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a43a4389", "timestamp": "2026-11-01T02:04:00", "text": "Sure, Charlie. I updated the data mapping configuration to match the current input data format. This involved modifying the mapping logic to ensure it dynamically adapts to schema changes in the future.", "utterranceID": "20261031-3-981b5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261031-3-981b5"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f98d7490", "timestamp": "2026-11-01T02:08:00", "text": "Great work, @eid_a43a4389! Does this mean we won't face similar issues with future schema updates?", "utterranceID": "20261031-4-60b1c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261031-4-60b1c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a43a4389", "timestamp": "2026-11-01T02:13:00", "text": "Exactly, Ian. The new configuration should automatically adjust to any schema changes, reducing the risk of similar issues.", "utterranceID": "20261031-5-589c9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261031-5-589c9"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_207da0e7", "timestamp": "2026-11-01T02:16:00", "text": "Thanks, Fiona. I'll run some tests on my end to ensure everything's working smoothly.", "utterranceID": "20261031-6-4a0cf"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261031-6-4a0cf"}
