{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-09-22T10:26:00", "text": "So, it's more of a data integrity issue rather than a bug in our system?", "utterranceID": "20260921-6-bdb18"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260921-6-bdb18"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df5d4b7", "timestamp": "2026-09-22T10:27:00", "text": "Exactly, Emma. Our system is designed to handle well-formed JSON as per the API specs. Handling every possible malformed structure would be inefficient and unnecessary.", "utterranceID": "20260921-7-325fc"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260921-7-325fc"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_92294e45", "timestamp": "2026-09-22T10:31:00", "text": "Thanks for clarifying, Bob. Did you take any action to verify this?", "utterranceID": "20260921-8-6f7e7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260921-8-6f7e7"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df5d4b7", "timestamp": "2026-09-22T10:34:00", "text": "Yes, I reviewed the logs and tested with both valid and intentionally malformed JSON. The system processed valid JSON correctly and only failed on malformed data, which is expected.", "utterranceID": "20260921-9-3c2d0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260921-9-3c2d0"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-09-22T10:37:00", "text": "Got it. Thanks for the thorough investigation, Bob.", "utterranceID": "20260921-10-949ce"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260921-10-949ce"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df5d4b7", "timestamp": "2026-09-22T10:41:00", "text": "No problem, happy to help! If any further issues arise, feel free to reach out.", "utterranceID": "20260921-11-8b26d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260921-11-8b26d"}

