{"Channel": {"name": "planning-ATF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-3a5e7c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6f719d21", "timestamp": "2026-06-21T14:05:00", "text": "@eid_b67edbb4 Good point, David. We should also consider if there's a lack of robust error handling or failover mechanisms in place.", "utterranceID": "20260709-3-ea64d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260709-3-ea64d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-ATF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-3a5e7c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8c71a7a9", "timestamp": "2026-06-21T14:09:00", "text": "Hannah here. Maybe the system wasn't tested enough under high-load scenarios. We should check the testing logs.", "utterranceID": "20260709-4-24bc7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260709-4-24bc7"}
